  const RESULTS=freeze([
    {"id":"c1-0001","situation":"big-win","text":"Turn the season's last page, and you'll find a winning name engraved in letters that refuse to shrink."},
    {"id":"c1-0002","situation":"big-win","text":"A narrow win might murmur, but this campaign has finished with the full voice of a cathedral bell."},
    {"id":"c1-0003","situation":"big-win","text":"No microscope is needed here, a season's work has produced a lead you could see from orbit."},
    {"id":"c1-0004","situation":"big-win","text":"Read those totals softly if you wish, {winnerClub}'s towering advantage will still be heard clearly."},
    {"id":"c1-0005","situation":"big-win","text":"Nothing hangs by a thread here, the winning effort rests on foundations laid deep and wide."},
    {"id":"c1-0006","situation":"big-win","text":"Above the final tally, {winner}'s name shines like a lighthouse, impossible to mistake at any distance."},
    {"id":"c1-0007","situation":"big-win","text":"The measure of this win is {margin}, not a slender step but a mighty stride forward."},
    {"id":"c1-0008","situation":"big-win","text":"If you wanted a tense finish, this season has offered something different, a victory of real breadth."},
    {"id":"c1-0009","situation":"big-win","text":"Every rivalry needs its wide victories too, and this one belongs emphatically to {winnerClub}."},
    {"id":"c1-0010","situation":"big-win","text":"Someone fetch a compass, {winnerClub} and the chasing tally have ended up on distant sides of the map."},
    {"id":"c1-0011","situation":"big-win","text":"You could park a commentary desk inside this margin and still leave room for the analysts."},
    {"id":"c1-0012","situation":"big-win","text":"Give {winner} a telescope, the rival's season total is somewhere back along the horizon."},
    {"id":"c1-0013","situation":"big-win","text":"No need for a photo finish here, the photographer could have gone home before the result."},
    {"id":"c1-0014","situation":"big-win","text":"Call the cartographer, the land separating these season totals deserves a fresh border."},
    {"id":"c1-0015","situation":"big-win","text":"That verdict could be whispered into a paper bag and still come out sounding enormous."},
    {"id":"c1-0016","situation":"big-win","text":"Ask the editor for more paper, {winnerClub}'s advantage simply will not fit in the margin."},
    {"id":"c1-0017","situation":"big-win","text":"They'll discuss this result over coffee, {winnerClub} having supplied enough material for several refills."},
    {"id":"c1-0018","situation":"big-win","text":"Just when you thought the totals might shake hands, one of them moved to another postcode."},
    {"id":"c1-0019","situation":"big-win","text":"There's an art to winning comfortably, and this emphatic result belongs in a gallery."},
    {"id":"c1-0020","situation":"big-win","text":"Try putting that advantage in a nutshell, you may need a rather larger shell."},
    {"id":"c1-0021","situation":"big-win","text":"In the quiet after the verdict, the winning advantage stands like a great arch against the sky."},
    {"id":"c1-0022","situation":"big-win","text":"Down comes the curtain on this season, and the name beneath the spotlight could hardly be clearer."},
    {"id":"c1-0023","situation":"big-win","text":"Behold this season's skyline, {winnerClub} towers over the other total like a city on a hill."},
    {"id":"c1-0024","situation":"big-win","text":"Let the figures come to rest, then hear how deep the hush becomes around this astonishing lead."},
    {"id":"c1-0025","situation":"big-win","text":"Here comes the measure, {margin} clear, the winning season ringing across the landscape like a brass bell."},
    {"id":"c1-0026","situation":"big-win","text":"No soft landing for suspense, this season's outcome arrives with the weight of a falling curtain."},
    {"id":"c1-0027","situation":"big-win","text":"Time holds its breath as the verdict lands, and this round belongs emphatically to {winner}."},
    {"id":"c1-0028","situation":"big-win","text":"A wide divide runs through these standings, with {winnerClub} secure on the victorious bank."},
    {"id":"c1-0029","situation":"big-win","text":"Never has a slender ribbon seemed less fitting, this season calls for a broad banner of triumph."},
    {"id":"c1-0030","situation":"big-win","text":"Even as the curtain falls, {winnerClub}'s emphatic advantage lingers like the last note of an orchestra."},
    {"id":"c1-0031","situation":"big-win","text":"Ink dries on the closing totals, and {winner} holds a season victory that leaves no question hanging."},
    {"id":"c1-0032","situation":"big-win","text":"Some victories arrive by inches, yet {winner} has left a whole stretch of country between the rivals."},
    {"id":"c1-0033","situation":"big-win","text":"What a gulf has opened here, and {loser} now has a shining target for the season to come."},
    {"id":"c1-0034","situation":"big-win","text":"Between {winner} and {loser} lies a margin large enough to set the tone for their next encounter."},
    {"id":"c1-0035","situation":"big-win","text":"This is a season victory with weight behind it, the kind that stays visible long after the page turns."},
    {"id":"c1-0036","situation":"big-win","text":"For all the rivalry's old familiarity, this season has arrived wearing the unfamiliar robes of a landslide."},
    {"id":"c1-0037","situation":"big-win","text":"Mark down {margin} as the separation, and {winner} can enjoy a campaign with no last-minute doubt."},
    {"id":"c1-0038","situation":"big-win","text":"Consider the finish, {winnerPoints} to {loserPoints}, and the distance has its own unmistakable music."},
    {"id":"c1-0039","situation":"big-win","text":"Once the dust of the verdict settles, {winner}'s towering lead will still stand above everything else."},
    {"id":"c1-0040","situation":"big-win","text":"So ends the campaign, with {winner} claiming the season and giving the next one a formidable benchmark."},
    {"id":"c1-0041","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"It's {winner} who takes the season, and that gap tells its own story. Clear daylight!"},
    {"id":"c1-0042","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"{winner} has the better of {loser}, no photo finish required this time."},
    {"id":"c1-0043","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"Listen to that verdict: {winnerClub} finish comfortably ahead of {loserClub}."},
    {"id":"c1-0044","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"Season {season} belongs to {winner}, with room to spare at the top."},
    {"id":"c1-0045","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"The table is settled, and {winner} stands a clear step ahead of {loser}."},
    {"id":"c1-0046","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"A proper winning margin for {winner}, enough to silence any argument about the result."},
    {"id":"c1-0047","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"There is the separation! {winner} takes the season without needing a last-gasp escape."},
    {"id":"c1-0048","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"Put {winnerClub} at the top of this season's ledger, a convincing result."},
    {"id":"c1-0049","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"That is daylight between them, with {winner} standing right in the middle of it."},
    {"id":"c1-0050","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"Look at the spread! {winner} takes it by {margin}, a clean and convincing gap."},
    {"id":"c1-0051","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"For {loser}, the chase ends here; {winner} has breathing space to celebrate."},
    {"id":"c1-0052","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"Here is your season winner: {winner}, with a lead that needs no explaining."},
    {"id":"c1-0053","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"What a result for {winner}! Not a runaway, but a very solid win."},
    {"id":"c1-0054","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"This one goes to {winner}, and the margin is more than a mere whisker."},
    {"id":"c1-0055","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"Set it down in the record: {winner} clears {loser} by {margin}."},
    {"id":"c1-0056","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"Up comes the final tally, and {winnerClub} holds a convincing advantage."},
    {"id":"c1-0057","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"You can see the daylight now, {winner} ahead and no doubt about the outcome."},
    {"id":"c1-0058","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"So the season closes with {winner} out in front, convincingly so."},
    {"id":"c1-0059","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"By {margin}, {winner} takes the verdict, and that's a healthy bit of separation!"},
    {"id":"c1-0060","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"That settles season {season}! {winner} is ahead by a comfortable distance."},
    {"id":"c1-0061","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"Firm and unmistakable, the edge belongs to {winner}, not a narrow scrape."},
    {"id":"c1-0062","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"Across the season totals, {winnerClub} comes out clearly above {loserClub}."},
    {"id":"c1-0063","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"Here comes the confirmation: {winner} takes this season by {margin}."},
    {"id":"c1-0064","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"A lead worth celebrating! {winner} has finished clearly ahead of {loser}."},
    {"id":"c1-0065","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"They've reached the verdict, and {winner} has taken a convincing season victory."},
    {"id":"c1-0066","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"There it is! {winnerClub} sit above {loserClub}, with space between them."},
    {"id":"c1-0067","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"Make that a comfortable season win for {winner}, and a deserved one at that."},
    {"id":"c1-0068","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"The result reads {winnerPoints} to {loserPoints}, and {winner} takes it convincingly."},
    {"id":"c1-0069","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"Ahead by {margin}, {winner} puts a decisive stamp on season {season}."},
    {"id":"c1-0070","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"And that is a win with room to breathe, {winner} takes this season!"},
    {"id":"c1-0071","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"If {loser} wanted a close finish, {winner} clearly had other plans."},
    {"id":"c1-0072","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"Not exactly a nail-biter, this one! {winner} has put daylight on the board."},
    {"id":"c1-0073","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"The numbers are being polite, but they're saying {winner} won rather comfortably."},
    {"id":"c1-0074","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"It wasn't a photo finish, and {winner} will be absolutely fine with that."},
    {"id":"c1-0075","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"A little breathing room? {winner} has managed rather more than a little!"},
    {"id":"c1-0076","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"Even the gap has its own seat at the table, and {winner} is sitting pretty!"},
    {"id":"c1-0077","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"Nobody has to lean in for this verdict, {winnerClub} have made it perfectly audible!"},
    {"id":"c1-0078","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"Has anyone got a tighter contest? Because {winner} has not supplied one!"},
    {"id":"c1-0079","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"That is what you call a bit of elbow room, {winner} takes the season!"},
    {"id":"c1-0080","situation":"comfortable-win","text":"A tidy little gap for {winner}, though {loser} may prefer a different adjective."},
    {"id":"c1-0081","situation":"narrow-win","text":"And there it is! {winner} takes season {season}, with barely daylight between the managers."},
    {"id":"c1-0082","situation":"narrow-win","text":"What a finish! {winnerClub} edges {loserClub}, and this season belongs to {winner}."},
    {"id":"c1-0083","situation":"narrow-win","text":"That is tight. {winner} has just held off {loser} by {margin}, right at the finish."},
    {"id":"c1-0084","situation":"narrow-win","text":"Look at that gap! {winner} is through by {margin}, after a season that refused to separate them."},
    {"id":"c1-0085","situation":"narrow-win","text":"It's {winner} on top! {loser} pushed all the way, but the final margin is razor thin."},
    {"id":"c1-0086","situation":"narrow-win","text":"Season {season} goes to {winner}! {loser} was close enough to make every point matter."},
    {"id":"c1-0087","situation":"narrow-win","text":"There is your verdict. {winnerClub} has the edge, but {loserClub} made it desperately close."},
    {"id":"c1-0088","situation":"narrow-win","text":"Unbelievably tight at the top, but {winner} gets the nod over {loser}."},
    {"id":"c1-0089","situation":"narrow-win","text":"Balanced on a knife edge, this season finally tilts toward {winner}!"},
    {"id":"c1-0090","situation":"narrow-win","text":"Just enough from {winner}, just not quite enough from {loser}. That's the season!"},
    {"id":"c1-0091","situation":"narrow-win","text":"The table can finally breathe! {winner} finishes narrowly clear of {loser}."},
    {"id":"c1-0092","situation":"narrow-win","text":"That's the finest of margins. {winnerClub} prevails over {loserClub} at the finish."},
    {"id":"c1-0093","situation":"narrow-win","text":"Nothing comfortable about that. {winner} has squeezed past {loser} to claim the season."},
    {"id":"c1-0094","situation":"narrow-win","text":"Here comes the verdict, and it's {winner}! The difference could scarcely be smaller."},
    {"id":"c1-0095","situation":"narrow-win","text":"You couldn't have asked for much closer. {winner} has scraped home against {loser}."},
    {"id":"c1-0096","situation":"narrow-win","text":"Every point counted, and {winner} has found just enough to finish ahead of {loser}."},
    {"id":"c1-0097","situation":"narrow-win","text":"Now the gap is official. {margin} between them, and {winner} takes the season."},
    {"id":"c1-0098","situation":"narrow-win","text":"Almost a dead heat, but not quite. {winner} has made the difference."},
    {"id":"c1-0099","situation":"narrow-win","text":"The season hangs on the finest thread, and {winner} comes out in front."},
    {"id":"c1-0100","situation":"narrow-win","text":"No room to relax for {winner}, but the final table puts them ahead of {loser}."},
    {"id":"c1-0101","situation":"narrow-win","text":"There were no acres of space here. {winner} edges it, and {loser} was right there."},
    {"id":"c1-0102","situation":"narrow-win","text":"This is seriously close, but not level! {winner} wins the season!"},
    {"id":"c1-0103","situation":"narrow-win","text":"Barely breathing room, but a full season to celebrate. {winner} takes the honors."},
    {"id":"c1-0104","situation":"narrow-win","text":"They can finally call it. {winner} has beaten {loser}, and only just."},
    {"id":"c1-0105","situation":"narrow-win","text":"That final tally says it all, {winnerPoints} to {loserPoints}, and {winner} survives the squeeze."},
    {"id":"c1-0106","situation":"narrow-win","text":"Tense to the last point! {winner} takes the spoils, {loser} takes the near miss."},
    {"id":"c1-0107","situation":"narrow-win","text":"Out of all that season's work, {margin} separates them! {winner} holds on."},
    {"id":"c1-0108","situation":"narrow-win","text":"Right at the line, {winner} nicks it from {loser}! What a season result."},
    {"id":"c1-0109","situation":"narrow-win","text":"Put {winner} at the top, but keep {loser} close beneath. That was a scrap."},
    {"id":"c1-0110","situation":"narrow-win","text":"You can see it in the standings. {winner} finishes ahead of {loser} by {margin}."},
    {"id":"c1-0111","situation":"narrow-win","text":"Absolutely nothing to spare. {winnerClub} has edged out {loserClub} for the season."},
    {"id":"c1-0112","situation":"narrow-win","text":"Listen to that verdict. {winner} ahead of {loser}, with hardly a gap to speak of."},
    {"id":"c1-0113","situation":"narrow-win","text":"Nowhere to hide in those figures. {winnerPoints} against {loserPoints}, and {winner} takes it."},
    {"id":"c1-0114","situation":"narrow-win","text":"A tight race, a clear result, and {winner} just about crosses ahead of {loser}!"},
    {"id":"c1-0115","situation":"narrow-win","text":"Such a slender lead. {winner} has done enough, with {loser} snapping at the heels."},
    {"id":"c1-0116","situation":"narrow-win","text":"Final figures, final verdict. {winner} wins this season by the tiniest gap."},
    {"id":"c1-0117","situation":"narrow-win","text":"Across the finish line comes {winner}, with {loser} close enough to feel the breeze!"},
    {"id":"c1-0118","situation":"narrow-win","text":"Someone find a magnifying glass! That's how narrow {winner}'s advantage over {loser} is."},
    {"id":"c1-0119","situation":"narrow-win","text":"Good luck calling that early! {winner} gets there, and {loser} almost steals the headline."},
    {"id":"c1-0120","situation":"narrow-win","text":"If {winner} wanted an easy finish, {loser} clearly didn't get the message!"},
    {"id":"c1-0121","situation":"draw","text":"Not a point between them! After everything this season held, there is nothing to separate these managers."},
    {"id":"c1-0122","situation":"draw","text":"{clubA} and {clubB} arrive at exactly the same total, and this rivalry refuses to choose a side."},
    {"id":"c1-0123","situation":"draw","text":"There is the verdict, and it's a draw! Neither {managerA} nor {managerB} owns this chapter."},
    {"id":"c1-0124","situation":"draw","text":"Everything comes to rest with {managerA} alongside {managerB}, equal in the only column that settles this."},
    {"id":"c1-0125","situation":"draw","text":"This one stays undecided! The season ends without a winner, but hardly without a story."},
    {"id":"c1-0126","situation":"draw","text":"And that's the finish! {managerA} matches {managerB} exactly, leaving this chapter beautifully balanced."},
    {"id":"c1-0127","situation":"draw","text":"At the final reading, {clubA} and {clubB} have reached precisely the same figure."},
    {"id":"c1-0128","situation":"draw","text":"A handshake would suit this result. {managerA} and {managerB} have produced a season no one can claim."},
    {"id":"c1-0129","situation":"draw","text":"Put away the victory speech! {clubA} and {clubB} have written a joint ending instead."},
    {"id":"c1-0130","situation":"draw","text":"Names in alphabetical order, then? It won't be points separating {managerA} and {managerB} this season."},
    {"id":"c1-0131","situation":"draw","text":"Just try telling either manager the other finished above them. You can't, because they didn't."},
    {"id":"c1-0132","situation":"draw","text":"Watch the pen hesitate over the winner's name. It stays blank, because this season ends tied."},
    {"id":"c1-0133","situation":"draw","text":"Difference? None at all. {clubA} and {clubB} have brought the season to a dead level."},
    {"id":"c1-0134","situation":"draw","text":"This is a truce in the points, not the rivalry. Nobody has taken the season outright."},
    {"id":"c1-0135","situation":"draw","text":"Everything converges here: {managerA} and {managerB} have ended the season with matching totals."},
    {"id":"c1-0136","situation":"draw","text":"Signed by both, owned by neither. {clubA} and {clubB} close this chapter level."},
    {"id":"c1-0137","situation":"draw","text":"There's no winner's walk this time. Both managers can hold their heads high after a season tied on points."},
    {"id":"c1-0138","situation":"draw","text":"Not so much as a sliver between them. {managerA} and {managerB} share the closing position."},
    {"id":"c1-0139","situation":"draw","text":"A season of rivalry reaches its final line, and both managers arrive together! What an ending!"},
    {"id":"c1-0140","situation":"draw","text":"It's level at the finish. {managerA} and {managerB} have reached the same place by the season's end."},
    {"id":"c1-0141","situation":"draw","text":"{managerA} has been matched all the way by {managerB}, and neither gives an inch on the season table."},
    {"id":"c1-0142","situation":"draw","text":"Nobody takes the season outright! {managerA} and {managerB} must share the final word."},
    {"id":"c1-0143","situation":"draw","text":"That is some finish. {managerA} and {managerB} have come through this season with equal returns."},
    {"id":"c1-0144","situation":"draw","text":"No daylight on the board! {clubA} and {clubB} stand perfectly level when it matters."},
    {"id":"c1-0145","situation":"draw","text":"All square at the close! {managerA} and {managerB} have reached the very same mark."},
    {"id":"c1-0146","situation":"draw","text":"Well, look at that! {clubA} cannot be split from {clubB} on the season standings."},
    {"id":"c1-0147","situation":"draw","text":"Some seasons spring surprises. This one has handed both managers equal billing in the final standings."},
    {"id":"c1-0148","situation":"draw","text":"Equal points, equal billing! {managerA} and {managerB} are sharing the season spotlight."},
    {"id":"c1-0149","situation":"draw","text":"We have a result, just not a winner. {managerA} and {managerB} have matched totals."},
    {"id":"c1-0150","situation":"draw","text":"Read the final figures however you like, {clubA} and {clubB} finish on precisely equal footing."},
    {"id":"c1-0151","situation":"draw","text":"Hear that? It's a level finish, and neither manager can claim an advantage from this season."},
    {"id":"c1-0152","situation":"draw","text":"Neither can break clear! {managerA} and {managerB} finish the season locked together."},
    {"id":"c1-0153","situation":"draw","text":"From opposite ends of the rivalry, {clubA} and {clubB} have arrived at the same season tally."},
    {"id":"c1-0154","situation":"draw","text":"Right at the end, the season refuses to separate {clubA} and {clubB}. It's a draw!"},
    {"id":"c1-0155","situation":"draw","text":"Side by side in that last column, {clubA} and {clubB} have made the final verdict a draw."},
    {"id":"c1-0156","situation":"draw","text":"There will be no sole winner here. This season belongs to {managerA} and {managerB} together."},
    {"id":"c1-0157","situation":"draw","text":"Consider how little separates them: {clubA} and {clubB} have ended up on identical points."},
    {"id":"c1-0158","situation":"draw","text":"You couldn't divide them! {managerA} and {managerB} are level when the season ends."},
    {"id":"c1-0159","situation":"draw","text":"An even finish can be the loudest result of all. Neither manager has broken away this season."},
    {"id":"c1-0160","situation":"draw","text":"Officially inseparable: {managerA} and {managerB} have arrived at matching season totals."},
    {"id":"c1-0161","situation":"champions-league","text":"Lift it high, {winner}! The Champions League belongs to {winnerClub}, and that's a moment to savour."},
    {"id":"c1-0162","situation":"champions-league","text":"Listen to that! {winnerClub} are champions of Europe, and {winner} has delivered the biggest prize!"},
    {"id":"c1-0163","situation":"champions-league","text":"You can hear the significance in those words: {winner}, Champions League winner. What a pairing!"},
    {"id":"c1-0164","situation":"champions-league","text":"A magnificent chapter for {winner}. The Champions League title is theirs, and so is this unforgettable moment."},
    {"id":"c1-0165","situation":"champions-league","text":"Champions League glory for {winnerClub}! That's the headline. The rest is just applause."},
    {"id":"c1-0166","situation":"champions-league","text":"Who needs a long speech when the cup says it all? {winnerClub}, champions of Europe!"},
    {"id":"c1-0167","situation":"champions-league","text":"The Champions League trophy doesn't fit in a quiet sentence, so here it is: {winnerClub} have won it!"},
    {"id":"c1-0168","situation":"champions-league","text":"The rivals can compare their seasons later. Right now, {winner}'s Champions League deserves centre stage."},
    {"id":"c1-0169","situation":"champions-league","text":"Even the rivalry has to yield the floor for a moment. {winner} is a European champion!"},
    {"id":"c1-0170","situation":"champions-league","text":"If you're keeping the season scrapbook, reserve the centre spread for {winner}'s Champions League triumph."},
    {"id":"c1-0171","situation":"champions-league","text":"Even a fierce rivalry knows when to applaud. That is a major European honour for {winnerClub}."},
    {"id":"c1-0172","situation":"champions-league","text":"There's the reward for reaching football's grandest club height: the Champions League for {winner}!"},
    {"id":"c1-0173","situation":"champions-league","text":"You want a statement of ambition? {winner} has made it, with the Champions League held aloft."},
    {"id":"c1-0174","situation":"champions-league","text":"Let's give that accomplishment its proper name: Champions League glory for {winnerClub}, and a wonderful moment."},
    {"id":"c1-0175","situation":"champions-league","text":"We can call it silver, call it history, call it whatever we like. {winnerClub} can call it theirs!"},
    {"id":"c1-0176","situation":"champions-league","text":"There it is, the prize every club dreams of, and {winner} has brought it home!"},
    {"id":"c1-0177","situation":"champions-league","text":"Up into the air goes the Champions League trophy, and {winner} has earned that extraordinary view!"},
    {"id":"c1-0178","situation":"champions-league","text":"Few announcements travel this far: {winnerClub} have claimed the Champions League, and Europe has heard!"},
    {"id":"c1-0179","situation":"champions-league","text":"That's the Champions League in {winner}'s hands, and suddenly this season has a golden spine."},
    {"id":"c1-0180","situation":"champions-league","text":"You can put that name in the European honours column now: {winnerClub}, standing proudly at the top."},
    {"id":"c1-0181","situation":"champions-league","text":"Just look where {winner} stands now, with the finest European club prize in hand!"},
    {"id":"c1-0182","situation":"champions-league","text":"Ordinary success can fade into a season. {winnerClub}'s Champions League title will not."},
    {"id":"c1-0183","situation":"champions-league","text":"Make room beside the old honours, {winnerClub}. The Champions League is coming home with you!"},
    {"id":"c1-0184","situation":"champions-league","text":"Forget the polite applause for a moment. {winnerClub} have captured the prize that commands a roar!"},
    {"id":"c1-0185","situation":"champions-league","text":"Write this across {winner}'s career story in the grandest letters: Champions League winner!"},
    {"id":"c1-0186","situation":"champions-league","text":"Nothing in the European club game quite matches that trophy, and now {winnerClub} have it!"},
    {"id":"c1-0187","situation":"champions-league","text":"Forget the score of this rivalry for a heartbeat. {winner} is holding the Champions League!"},
    {"id":"c1-0188","situation":"champions-league","text":"Picture the display in years to come: {winner}'s name beside a Champions League triumph."},
    {"id":"c1-0189","situation":"champions-league","text":"Take the curtain away, and there it is: a Champions League triumph for {winnerClub}!"},
    {"id":"c1-0190","situation":"champions-league","text":"High above the usual honours sits this famous cup. {winnerClub} have taken Europe's greatest club prize."},
    {"id":"c1-0191","situation":"champions-league","text":"Remember the name in this moment: {winner}, winner of the Champions League. That carries weight."},
    {"id":"c1-0192","situation":"champions-league","text":"Suddenly the trophy shelves feel a little smaller. {winnerClub} have won a giant of a prize!"},
    {"id":"c1-0193","situation":"champions-league","text":"Ask what defines {winnerClub}'s campaign, and that Champions League triumph answers before anyone speaks."},
    {"id":"c1-0194","situation":"champions-league","text":"Even the manager's handbook has no way of preparing you for a trophy as special as this."},
    {"id":"c1-0195","situation":"champions-league","text":"See those colours on a European champion? That's {winnerClub}'s achievement, delivered by {winner}!"},
    {"id":"c1-0196","situation":"champions-league","text":"No small trophy, no passing mention. {winner} has put a Champions League triumph on the board."},
    {"id":"c1-0197","situation":"champions-league","text":"Try finding a better centrepiece for a season than the Champions League. You won't manage it."},
    {"id":"c1-0198","situation":"champions-league","text":"Up goes the trophy for {winnerClub}, a European prize carrying the weight of an entire campaign."},
    {"id":"c1-0199","situation":"champions-league","text":"Prestige is a word used too easily in football; {winner} has given it proper meaning here."},
    {"id":"c1-0200","situation":"champions-league","text":"Allow the picture to settle: {winner} has delivered Europe's highest club honour, and it belongs to {winnerClub}."},
    {"id":"c1-0201","situation":"europa-league","text":"Tuck this moment away, {winner}. Continental titles are the kind of memories that never need polishing."},
    {"id":"c1-0202","situation":"europa-league","text":"What a distinction for {winnerClub}: winners of the Europa League, and nobody can dispute that."},
    {"id":"c1-0203","situation":"europa-league","text":"All the ambition in the world means little without the finish. {winner} has provided the finish."},
    {"id":"c1-0204","situation":"europa-league","text":"Seal the European chapter in bold. {winnerClub} have done the hard part and won the Europa League."},
    {"id":"c1-0205","situation":"europa-league","text":"Some triumphs fit into a brief report. This one demands the words Europa League champions in full."},
    {"id":"c1-0206","situation":"europa-league","text":"Forget the postcards. The best souvenir from a European campaign is the honour you can put on display."},
    {"id":"c1-0207","situation":"europa-league","text":"Tomorrow the friendly argument returns. Today, a European title has earned a moment of respect."},
    {"id":"c1-0208","situation":"europa-league","text":"Flip through the season's memories, and this trophy is the page nobody will want to skip."},
    {"id":"c1-0209","situation":"europa-league","text":"Europa League glory for {winnerClub}, and there's a European journey that ends with something worth holding."},
    {"id":"c1-0210","situation":"europa-league","text":"From a competition full of ambition comes a champion, and {winnerClub} have taken their chance!"},
    {"id":"c1-0211","situation":"europa-league","text":"Look what {winner} has brought back from Europe! Not just a memory, but a title."},
    {"id":"c1-0212","situation":"europa-league","text":"Read the name on this honour: {winnerClub}. The Europa League has found its new champion."},
    {"id":"c1-0213","situation":"europa-league","text":"Here's a moment for {winner} to remember. European ambition has become a title, not just a promise."},
    {"id":"c1-0214","situation":"europa-league","text":"No longer a European ambition for {winnerClub}. The Europa League is theirs, in silver and in history."},
    {"id":"c1-0215","situation":"europa-league","text":"Watch this season take on a different shape. {winner} has written a European victory into it."},
    {"id":"c1-0216","situation":"europa-league","text":"At the end of that continental road, {winnerClub} stand with the prize they went looking for."},
    {"id":"c1-0217","situation":"europa-league","text":"Steady hands, big ambition: {winner} has turned the Europa League challenge into a magnificent triumph."},
    {"id":"c1-0218","situation":"europa-league","text":"Call the roll of European winners and add {winnerClub}. This is their moment in the competition's history."},
    {"id":"c1-0219","situation":"europa-league","text":"A passport full of memories is fine, {winner}, but this is the souvenir that goes into the cabinet."},
    {"id":"c1-0220","situation":"europa-league","text":"Try saying it without a smile: {winnerClub} have won the Europa League. That has a lovely ring."},
    {"id":"c1-0221","situation":"europa-league","text":"Take it in, {winnerClub}. The Europa League winners' roll has a new name, and it's yours."},
    {"id":"c1-0222","situation":"europa-league","text":"Now there's a different weight to this season. {winner} has lifted a trophy from Europe's stage."},
    {"id":"c1-0223","situation":"europa-league","text":"Across Europe this trophy commands respect, and {winnerClub} have earned the right to claim it."},
    {"id":"c1-0224","situation":"europa-league","text":"Give {winner} the applause this deserves. A major continental honour is not something to hurry past."},
    {"id":"c1-0225","situation":"europa-league","text":"Put a European trophy beside the badge and suddenly {winnerClub}'s season has a different meaning."},
    {"id":"c1-0226","situation":"europa-league","text":"Make some room, {winner}! That Europa League trophy is not a small parcel to bring home."},
    {"id":"c1-0227","situation":"europa-league","text":"In the proudest part of the honours list, put {winnerClub} down as Europa League winners."},
    {"id":"c1-0228","situation":"europa-league","text":"It's a fine thing to dream of silverware abroad; {winner} has gone and brought it back!"},
    {"id":"c1-0229","situation":"europa-league","text":"Put that European adventure in the books. {winnerClub} have written the closing line in silver."},
    {"id":"c1-0230","situation":"europa-league","text":"Borders are part of the adventure, but {winner} has brought the achievement right back home."},
    {"id":"c1-0231","situation":"europa-league","text":"Listen to that description of {winnerClub}: Europa League winners. It fits them rather nicely!"},
    {"id":"c1-0232","situation":"europa-league","text":"Not every European story gets a silver ending, but {winner} has written precisely that one."},
    {"id":"c1-0233","situation":"europa-league","text":"Raise the curtain on the honours list: {winnerClub} have become Europa League champions."},
    {"id":"c1-0234","situation":"europa-league","text":"Nobody gets an advance promise of European glory. {winner} has gone and secured it."},
    {"id":"c1-0235","situation":"europa-league","text":"That name belongs in the European honours list now. {winnerClub} have won their place."},
    {"id":"c1-0236","situation":"europa-league","text":"Set aside the ordinary headlines! {winner} has a European trophy to put above the season's noise."},
    {"id":"c1-0237","situation":"europa-league","text":"Follow the European trail all the way to {winnerClub}, and you'll find silver at the end."},
    {"id":"c1-0238","situation":"europa-league","text":"Take a second to appreciate that achievement. A European tournament won, a special honour secured."},
    {"id":"c1-0239","situation":"europa-league","text":"And what a finish to this European chapter for {winner}: the Europa League trophy itself!"},
    {"id":"c1-0240","situation":"europa-league","text":"Nothing cryptic about the headline: {winnerClub} have lifted the Europa League trophy."},
    {"id":"c1-0241","situation":"league-title","text":"An empty space in the cabinet has just found its purpose. {winner} has a championship to display."},
    {"id":"c1-0242","situation":"league-title","text":"Between wanting a league crown and wearing it lies a season's work. {winnerClub} have made that journey."},
    {"id":"c1-0243","situation":"league-title","text":"Write the headline in permanent ink: {winner} has earned a place among this season's league champions."},
    {"id":"c1-0244","situation":"league-title","text":"At last, a champion to name! {winnerClub} have given this league season its defining achievement."},
    {"id":"c1-0245","situation":"league-title","text":"That word on the honours list is worth saying aloud. {winner}, league champion. Sounds good, doesn't it?"},
    {"id":"c1-0246","situation":"league-title","text":"Spare a thought for the trophy engraver, because {winnerClub} have given them another job."},
    {"id":"c1-0247","situation":"league-title","text":"Scratch league champion off the dream list. {winner} has turned that particular hope into silverware!"},
    {"id":"c1-0248","situation":"league-title","text":"Somebody tell the display cabinet there's a new resident. The league trophy has found its owner!"},
    {"id":"c1-0249","situation":"league-title","text":"Call off the search for a fitting headline. 'League champions' will do very nicely!"},
    {"id":"c1-0250","situation":"league-title","text":"There's a certain satisfaction in saying it plainly. {winner} has won the league!"},
    {"id":"c1-0251","situation":"league-title","text":"Nobody needs to dress this achievement up. The league trophy does a fine job on its own!"},
    {"id":"c1-0252","situation":"league-title","text":"Behind that cabinet glass sits a prize that changes how a season is remembered: the league title."},
    {"id":"c1-0253","situation":"league-title","text":"Give that title its own line in the scrapbook. {winner} has made the domestic season count."},
    {"id":"c1-0254","situation":"league-title","text":"Nothing fancy needed from the announcer. {winner} has won the league, and that's plenty!"},
    {"id":"c1-0255","situation":"league-title","text":"Put that ruler away. The size of a league championship isn't measured in inches!"},
    {"id":"c1-0256","situation":"league-title","text":"That trophy case has a reason to look proud, and {winner} has supplied it: a league championship."},
    {"id":"c1-0257","situation":"league-title","text":"Listen closely, because these are the words {winner} will remember: you are the league champion!"},
    {"id":"c1-0258","situation":"league-title","text":"Imagine hearing it announced for the first time. {winner} is the champion of the league!"},
    {"id":"c1-0259","situation":"league-title","text":"On the grandest domestic stage, {winnerClub} have claimed the honour every rival wanted!"},
    {"id":"c1-0260","situation":"league-title","text":"You can say it softly or shout it from the rooftops: {winnerClub} are champions of their league!"},
    {"id":"c1-0261","situation":"league-title","text":"Picture the season as a book. {winnerClub} have written 'league champions' on the cover."},
    {"id":"c1-0262","situation":"league-title","text":"Hear the certainty in that announcement: the league crown has been decided, and it belongs to a champion!"},
    {"id":"c1-0263","situation":"league-title","text":"If you need an ending to a domestic campaign, a champion's trophy is a rather beautiful one."},
    {"id":"c1-0264","situation":"league-title","text":"Somewhere along a long league road, a contender becomes a champion. That moment is here!"},
    {"id":"c1-0265","situation":"league-title","text":"Few phrases carry so much work in so little space: champion of the league!"},
    {"id":"c1-0266","situation":"league-title","text":"That championship trophy cannot settle the whole rivalry by itself, but it has made its mark!"},
    {"id":"c1-0267","situation":"league-title","text":"One trophy can change the punctuation of a season: from a question mark to an exclamation!"},
    {"id":"c1-0268","situation":"league-title","text":"Not every great result needs a trumpet fanfare. The words 'league champions' are celebration enough."},
    {"id":"c1-0269","situation":"league-title","text":"Praise comes and goes, but the league champion's place in the honours book is there to stay."},
    {"id":"c1-0270","situation":"league-title","text":"You needn't add a flourish. Being called league champion is a grand enough ending already!"},
    {"id":"c1-0271","situation":"league-title","text":"League champions! {winnerClub} have earned the prize that every domestic rival was chasing this season."},
    {"id":"c1-0272","situation":"league-title","text":"And listen to this for a finish: {winner} is the league champion, with the season's biggest domestic prize!"},
    {"id":"c1-0273","situation":"league-title","text":"Confirmed at the top! {winnerClub} have completed a league campaign worth remembering for all the right reasons."},
    {"id":"c1-0274","situation":"league-title","text":"That title belongs to {winnerClub}! A season of domestic ambition ends with the ultimate reward."},
    {"id":"c1-0275","situation":"league-title","text":"So it is settled: the league crown goes to {winnerClub}, and this season has its champions."},
    {"id":"c1-0276","situation":"league-title","text":"They wanted the top prize at home, and {winnerClub} have made it theirs."},
    {"id":"c1-0277","situation":"league-title","text":"Mark the achievement, not merely the occasion: {winner} has guided a club to the league title."},
    {"id":"c1-0278","situation":"league-title","text":"Now it's official for {winnerClub}: the domestic prize every challenger wanted is theirs to keep."},
    {"id":"c1-0279","situation":"league-title","text":"It takes a full season to earn that distinction. {winner} can call themselves a league champion."},
    {"id":"c1-0280","situation":"league-title","text":"What an entry on the honours board for {winnerClub}! The league championship is going beside their name."},
    {"id":"c1-0281","situation":"cup-double","text":"Champions in the league, winners of the cup! {winnerClub} have completed the domestic double!"},
    {"id":"c1-0282","situation":"cup-double","text":"A league title demands staying power, a domestic cup its own nerve. {winner} has answered both calls!"},
    {"id":"c1-0283","situation":"cup-double","text":"Just listen to those honours: the league title and domestic cup, both in {winner}'s hands!"},
    {"id":"c1-0284","situation":"cup-double","text":"League success calls for stamina. Cup success makes different demands. {winnerClub} have mastered both!"},
    {"id":"c1-0285","situation":"cup-double","text":"Separate roads, same destination: league champions and domestic cup winners. The double is complete!"},
    {"id":"c1-0286","situation":"cup-double","text":"Nobody has to pick the headline. The league crown and domestic cup make quite a joint announcement."},
    {"id":"c1-0287","situation":"cup-double","text":"League champions. Cup winners. Read it again, because {winner} has made a domestic double real!"},
    {"id":"c1-0288","situation":"cup-double","text":"A title in the league, a triumph in the cup! {winner} has brought both together!"},
    {"id":"c1-0289","situation":"cup-double","text":"Somebody check the shelving! {winner} has made the league and cup trophies permanent fixtures of this season."},
    {"id":"c1-0290","situation":"cup-double","text":"Where does the cup go when the league title already has pride of place? Delightful dilemma."},
    {"id":"c1-0291","situation":"cup-double","text":"Could {winner} ask for a little more room in the trophy cabinet? The domestic double demands it!"},
    {"id":"c1-0292","situation":"cup-double","text":"What is the etiquette for a double? Does the league trophy greet the cup, or the other way round?"},
    {"id":"c1-0293","situation":"cup-double","text":"Feel the weight of that achievement. A league title, a domestic cup, a season that deserves applause."},
    {"id":"c1-0294","situation":"cup-double","text":"Through the league's long demands and the cup's very different challenge, the honours have gone together."},
    {"id":"c1-0295","situation":"cup-double","text":"High on the league table, and on the cup's honours list! {winner} has reached both summits."},
    {"id":"c1-0296","situation":"cup-double","text":"Different paths to glory, same destination. The league crown and the domestic cup share a winner."},
    {"id":"c1-0297","situation":"cup-double","text":"Few achievements give a domestic season such stature. {winner} has the league-and-cup double."},
    {"id":"c1-0298","situation":"cup-double","text":"Cup triumph has its magic, league glory its own weight. Together, they make a season to treasure."},
    {"id":"c1-0299","situation":"cup-double","text":"And what an extraordinary companion for that championship: a domestic cup, earned in the same season."},
    {"id":"c1-0300","situation":"cup-double","text":"Which achievement deserves top billing? The league crown or the domestic cup? What a choice to have."},
    {"id":"c1-0301","situation":"cup-double","text":"Read that honours board aloud: league champions and domestic cup winners. Yes, the same club!"},
    {"id":"c1-0302","situation":"cup-double","text":"Imagine opening the cabinet years later: a league trophy and domestic cup together, defining the season."},
    {"id":"c1-0303","situation":"cup-double","text":"Ask what defines this season for {winnerClub}, and there is a lovely answer: league and cup winners."},
    {"id":"c1-0304","situation":"cup-double","text":"Some seasons have a trophy to remember. This one has the league title and the domestic cup together."},
    {"id":"c1-0305","situation":"cup-double","text":"Let the celebrations take their time. A league championship and domestic cup make a magnificent pairing."},
    {"id":"c1-0306","situation":"cup-double","text":"Listen to that verdict! The league championship and domestic cup both belong to {winner}. A magnificent double."},
    {"id":"c1-0307","situation":"cup-double","text":"Both home honours, secured in the same campaign! {winnerClub} can call themselves double winners."},
    {"id":"c1-0308","situation":"cup-double","text":"You can win a championship and call it a great season. Add the domestic cup, and it becomes something else."},
    {"id":"c1-0309","situation":"cup-double","text":"Different challenges, one formidable achievement. {winnerClub} have won the league and the domestic cup!"},
    {"id":"c1-0310","situation":"cup-double","text":"Cup winners in the same breath as league champions. {winner} has made those words belong together."},
    {"id":"c1-0311","situation":"cup-double","text":"Every league title carries weight. Every domestic cup has its own shine. {winner} has both."},
    {"id":"c1-0312","situation":"cup-double","text":"Think of the contrasting demands: a league campaign, a cup challenge, and a club that conquered both."},
    {"id":"c1-0313","situation":"cup-double","text":"That championship belongs to {winner}, and so does the domestic cup. There is the season's real headline."},
    {"id":"c1-0314","situation":"cup-double","text":"No choosing between league glory and cup glory here. {winnerClub} have taken both honours!"},
    {"id":"c1-0315","situation":"cup-double","text":"This is the season {winner} can point to proudly: champions of the league and holders of the cup!"},
    {"id":"c1-0316","situation":"cup-double","text":"No separating those achievements now! The league title and domestic cup both belong to {winnerClub}."},
    {"id":"c1-0317","situation":"cup-double","text":"Different competitions, different pressures, the same winning manager. {winner} has the domestic double!"},
    {"id":"c1-0318","situation":"cup-double","text":"There are fine domestic seasons, and there are doubles. {winnerClub} have the league and cup honours!"},
    {"id":"c1-0319","situation":"cup-double","text":"It's that rare combination: the league title earned over a campaign and a cup to sit beside it."},
    {"id":"c1-0320","situation":"cup-double","text":"Hear it in full: {winnerClub} are league champions and domestic cup holders. A remarkable double."},
    {"id":"c1-0321","situation":"no-trophy","text":"A trophy wasn't necessary for the winning manager, and that is the surprise at the heart of this result."},
    {"id":"c1-0322","situation":"no-trophy","text":"By the finest of differences, {winnerClub} have the season. The reward is real, even without a trophy."},
    {"id":"c1-0323","situation":"no-trophy","text":"Take another look at that result: {winner} is ahead, even though the silverware stayed out of reach."},
    {"id":"c1-0324","situation":"no-trophy","text":"That's the beauty of this contest: you can miss the big prizes and still finish the season in front."},
    {"id":"c1-0325","situation":"no-trophy","text":"Some victories come with a new place in the cabinet. {winnerClub} have one that fits on the season summary."},
    {"id":"c1-0326","situation":"no-trophy","text":"Missing from the honours list, but not the winner's column. {winner} has made that possible."},
    {"id":"c1-0327","situation":"no-trophy","text":"You won't find this victory on the mantelpiece; {winner} has put it where the season's result is recorded."},
    {"id":"c1-0328","situation":"no-trophy","text":"A trophyless winner sounds like a contradiction, until you see what {winnerClub} have done with the bonuses."},
    {"id":"c1-0329","situation":"no-trophy","text":"Season winners without being cup winners? {winner} has made the unlikely distinction work."},
    {"id":"c1-0330","situation":"no-trophy","text":"On a season of slim pickings, {winner} managed to turn the small rewards into the decisive ones."},
    {"id":"c1-0331","situation":"no-trophy","text":"A close finish with no trophy for the winner. There's a season result worth looking at twice."},
    {"id":"c1-0332","situation":"no-trophy","text":"Small rewards can make a sizeable difference. {winner} has proved it by finishing above {loser} this season."},
    {"id":"c1-0333","situation":"no-trophy","text":"Up goes the result instead of a cup, and {winnerClub} have something to be proud of."},
    {"id":"c1-0334","situation":"no-trophy","text":"A curious finish for {winner}: nothing to set on the mantelpiece, but the season belongs to them."},
    {"id":"c1-0335","situation":"no-trophy","text":"Imagine the season champion with nothing new to polish. An odd ending, but a thoroughly deserved result."},
    {"id":"c1-0336","situation":"no-trophy","text":"Modest rewards, mighty consequence. This season shows how much the unglamorous parts can matter."},
    {"id":"c1-0337","situation":"no-trophy","text":"There's a neat little paradox for you: a winning season with no trophy to prove it."},
    {"id":"c1-0338","situation":"no-trophy","text":"Here's a riddle for {loser}: how do you finish behind a rival who hasn't lifted a cup?"},
    {"id":"c1-0339","situation":"no-trophy","text":"No cup for {winner}, yet there it is, a season win. A victory outside the usual spotlight."},
    {"id":"c1-0340","situation":"no-trophy","text":"Those extra credits might look modest, but this season they carry the full weight of the result."},
    {"id":"c1-0341","situation":"no-trophy","text":"{winner} won't be calling the engraver, but the season is theirs. Sometimes the quiet work wins out."},
    {"id":"c1-0342","situation":"no-trophy","text":"Look at that! No silverware for {winnerClub}, yet the season belongs to them all the same."},
    {"id":"c1-0343","situation":"no-trophy","text":"Every little advantage mattered, and {winner} has finished in front without a major honour to show for it."},
    {"id":"c1-0344","situation":"no-trophy","text":"Set aside the main prizes for a moment. {winnerClub} have taken this season through what they did beyond them."},
    {"id":"c1-0345","situation":"no-trophy","text":"Here comes the season verdict: {winner} takes it, with no new cup to place beside the old ones."},
    {"id":"c1-0346","situation":"no-trophy","text":"It wasn't a glittering haul, but {winner} made the details count when the season was settled."},
    {"id":"c1-0347","situation":"no-trophy","text":"No prize to hold above their head, yet {winner} has a season victory to savour."},
    {"id":"c1-0348","situation":"no-trophy","text":"That is a fine piece of management from {winner}: the season secured without a trophy to carry home."},
    {"id":"c1-0349","situation":"no-trophy","text":"Who needs a ribbon on the handle? {winnerClub} have won the season without taking a cup."},
    {"id":"c1-0350","situation":"no-trophy","text":"There's your unlikely winner: {winner}, with the season secured and nothing new in the trophy room."},
    {"id":"c1-0351","situation":"no-trophy","text":"Nothing changes on the display shelf, but the rivalry takes a turn in favour of {winnerClub}."},
    {"id":"c1-0352","situation":"no-trophy","text":"Elsewhere the cups may find their homes. Here, the season belongs to {winner} on the strength of the extras."},
    {"id":"c1-0353","situation":"no-trophy","text":"Count the little contributions, and there it is: a trophyless success for {winnerClub}!"},
    {"id":"c1-0354","situation":"no-trophy","text":"It takes an unusual season to win without lifting anything. {winner} has just produced one!"},
    {"id":"c1-0355","situation":"no-trophy","text":"For {winnerClub}, the most important addition isn't an object. It's a winning season in the rivalry."},
    {"id":"c1-0356","situation":"no-trophy","text":"Credit where it's due! {winner} found a winning route through a season without a cup to show."},
    {"id":"c1-0357","situation":"no-trophy","text":"Watch the supporting points take centre stage. {winner} has turned them into a season victory."},
    {"id":"c1-0358","situation":"no-trophy","text":"Not every victory arrives wrapped in ribbons. {winnerClub} have proved that with this season's outcome!"},
    {"id":"c1-0359","situation":"no-trophy","text":"Quiet contributions, decisive effect. {winner} has won the season without a trophy to their name."},
    {"id":"c1-0360","situation":"no-trophy","text":"It may not come with a medal ceremony, but {winner} is the season's winning manager."},
    {"id":"c1-0361","situation":"comeback","text":"Straight back into the contest! A season win has taken a bite out of that earlier advantage."},
    {"id":"c1-0362","situation":"comeback","text":"What a reply from {winner}! The season is theirs, and the overall chase has fresh life."},
    {"id":"c1-0363","situation":"comeback","text":"Season victory secured, and an old deficit loses some of its bite. This rivalry is alive!"},
    {"id":"c1-0364","situation":"comeback","text":"Listen again to that result! The pursuit has fresh power, and the lead has taken a knock."},
    {"id":"c1-0365","situation":"comeback","text":"Not every fightback needs fireworks. Sometimes a single season victory does the heavy lifting."},
    {"id":"c1-0366","situation":"comeback","text":"Forget any thought of cruising home! An overall advantage has just suffered a serious cut."},
    {"id":"c1-0367","situation":"comeback","text":"There's life in the pursuit! A season victory has shortened the distance in the Showdown."},
    {"id":"c1-0368","situation":"comeback","text":"Back in the hunt! A winning season takes a chunk out of what looked a daunting deficit."},
    {"id":"c1-0369","situation":"comeback","text":"Firmly back in pursuit! The season is won, the overall deficit reduced, and the pressure returns."},
    {"id":"c1-0370","situation":"comeback","text":"Rivalry renewed, and how! This winning season has brought the bigger prize appreciably nearer."},
    {"id":"c1-0371","situation":"comeback","text":"Down goes a slice of that advantage! A wonderful response has changed the whole tone of this Showdown."},
    {"id":"c1-0372","situation":"comeback","text":"What matters here is not where {winner} began, but how much closer this season has brought them."},
    {"id":"c1-0373","situation":"comeback","text":"Now the pursuit has a whole new edge! A season taken, and the overall advantage reduced."},
    {"id":"c1-0374","situation":"comeback","text":"Listen to that turnaround! A deficit cut down, and suddenly the rivalry has a different heartbeat."},
    {"id":"c1-0375","situation":"comeback","text":"That's a proper response from {winner}. The overall deficit has taken a useful knock."},
    {"id":"c1-0376","situation":"comeback","text":"This is more than a seasonal victory for {winner}. The accumulated arrears have finally shrunk."},
    {"id":"c1-0377","situation":"comeback","text":"Well judged from {winner}. You cannot overturn a deficit without first making it smaller."},
    {"id":"c1-0378","situation":"comeback","text":"It's a reminder that {winner} was trailing, not finished. The latest victory proves the distinction."},
    {"id":"c1-0379","situation":"comeback","text":"There's no shortcut through those arrears. The pursuing manager has chosen a sensible route."},
    {"id":"c1-0380","situation":"comeback","text":"A useful change for {winner}: the manager ahead is noticeably nearer than before."},
    {"id":"c1-0381","situation":"comeback","text":"{winner} has not settled the wider argument, but has made the next chapter worth reading."},
    {"id":"c1-0382","situation":"comeback","text":"Reduced arrears don't happen by accident; {winnerClub} delivered across an entire campaign."},
    {"id":"c1-0383","situation":"comeback","text":"Even {loserClub} cannot ignore how much force the latest pursuit has gained."},
    {"id":"c1-0384","situation":"comeback","text":"Thanks to {winner}, the old separation in this competition has been cut back."},
    {"id":"c1-0385","situation":"comeback","text":"Perhaps {loser} will look at that previous cushion with a touch less affection after that."},
    {"id":"c1-0386","situation":"comeback","text":"{winner} is still writing this rivalry, rather than accepting the ending someone else had imagined."},
    {"id":"c1-0387","situation":"comeback","text":"How much closer can this become? {winner} has at least supplied a convincing first answer."},
    {"id":"c1-0388","situation":"comeback","text":"Experience teaches a sound lesson here: a head start only comforts you while it holds."},
    {"id":"c1-0389","situation":"comeback","text":"Those old arrears have new terms. This time it's the pursuer doing the negotiating."},
    {"id":"c1-0390","situation":"comeback","text":"Funny how that comfortable chair of {loser}'s suddenly needs a little more padding."},
    {"id":"c1-0391","situation":"comeback","text":"While that old advantage remains, {loser} finally has less time for self-congratulation."},
    {"id":"c1-0392","situation":"comeback","text":"Not a complete renovation, this, but {winner} has certainly knocked down an inconvenient wall."},
    {"id":"c1-0393","situation":"comeback","text":"Interesting repair work from {winner}. Those overall arrears were beginning to look seriously expensive."},
    {"id":"c1-0394","situation":"comeback","text":"Here's {winner} doing the sensible thing: shortening the journey before discussing the destination."},
    {"id":"c1-0395","situation":"comeback","text":"Quite right that {loserClub} should retain confidence. A lead still has to be defended."},
    {"id":"c1-0396","situation":"comeback","text":"Hardly a time for {loser} to panic, but checking the rearview mirror seems sensible again."},
    {"id":"c1-0397","situation":"comeback","text":"Under 'comfortable advantage' in the filing cabinet, someone has thoughtfully added 'revised'."},
    {"id":"c1-0398","situation":"comeback","text":"You'd rather have a shorter distance than a stirring speech about trying harder. That's progress."},
    {"id":"c1-0399","situation":"comeback","text":"Suddenly the side behind looks like an awkward guest who has no intention of leaving."},
    {"id":"c1-0400","situation":"comeback","text":"It's not the finish line, but the chase finally has decent shoes on."},
    {"id":"c1-0401","situation":"lead-extended","text":"That's the value of {leader} keeping standards up. The chasing job has just become heavier."},
    {"id":"c1-0402","situation":"lead-extended","text":"Notice how {winnerClub} have handled this. No fuss, just another useful separation in the standings."},
    {"id":"c1-0403","situation":"lead-extended","text":"A good cushion can tempt a manager into caution; {leader} has chosen to add another layer."},
    {"id":"c1-0404","situation":"lead-extended","text":"There'll be plenty of talk about momentum, but {leader} has something better: another season in the bag."},
    {"id":"c1-0405","situation":"lead-extended","text":"Again is the significant word here. Each repeated success changes the burden on the rival."},
    {"id":"c1-0406","situation":"lead-extended","text":"I wouldn't write off {trailer}. I'd simply recommend a rather larger notebook for the comeback plan."},
    {"id":"c1-0407","situation":"lead-extended","text":"Some victories change the direction of a rivalry. This one makes its existing direction more pronounced."},
    {"id":"c1-0408","situation":"lead-extended","text":"Was that door still open? Certainly. But it's a heavier door to push now."},
    {"id":"c1-0409","situation":"lead-extended","text":"Keeping first place asks for restraint. Improving it demands an appetite that clearly hasn't faded."},
    {"id":"c1-0410","situation":"lead-extended","text":"{loser} will know a reply is possible, but a polite reply won't shift this balance."},
    {"id":"c1-0411","situation":"lead-extended","text":"Here's the awkward bit for the chaser: a better next season may still leave plenty to do."},
    {"id":"c1-0412","situation":"lead-extended","text":"I like the lack of ceremony from {winner}. A valuable result, treated as another job completed."},
    {"id":"c1-0413","situation":"lead-extended","text":"That'll make for awkward conversations in the other dugout. The task has become a good deal harder."},
    {"id":"c1-0414","situation":"lead-extended","text":"Watch the order of things: {winnerClub} bank the season first, then the wider contest takes shape."},
    {"id":"c1-0415","situation":"lead-extended","text":"Not much sympathy from the standings; {trailer} now has a longer argument to make."},
    {"id":"c1-0416","situation":"lead-extended","text":"Pressure has been returned to sender, neatly addressed to the manager doing the chasing."},
    {"id":"c1-0417","situation":"lead-extended","text":"There's still pride in the challenge for {trailer}, though the route has acquired a few extra bends."},
    {"id":"c1-0418","situation":"lead-extended","text":"A moving target is nuisance enough. Watching it pick up speed is no one's idea of relief."},
    {"id":"c1-0419","situation":"lead-extended","text":"Who wouldn't prefer a stationary target? {trailer} has been given rather the opposite."},
    {"id":"c1-0420","situation":"lead-extended","text":"Picture an already polished display case; {winner} has found a reason to buff the glass again."},
    {"id":"c1-0421","situation":"lead-extended","text":"You can hear the imaginary pencil scratching. The chaser's plan has just needed another revision."},
    {"id":"c1-0422","situation":"lead-extended","text":"What's striking isn't another victory while ahead. It's the refusal to let this contest settle."},
    {"id":"c1-0423","situation":"lead-extended","text":"As if first place weren't comfortable enough, someone's brought in the good chairs."},
    {"id":"c1-0424","situation":"lead-extended","text":"Dryly impressive from {winner}. Winning from the front looks simple, though the rival knows better."},
    {"id":"c1-0425","situation":"lead-extended","text":"This has the feel of an orderly office, with the rival's paperwork piling up next door."},
    {"id":"c1-0426","situation":"lead-extended","text":"Progress, not promise, is what {trailer} needs. The difference between those words has grown."},
    {"id":"c1-0427","situation":"lead-extended","text":"Front-door security has tightened. The challenger will need more than a polite knock."},
    {"id":"c1-0428","situation":"lead-extended","text":"Still, {trailer} hasn't run out of arguments. The strongest one now needs to be played, not spoken."},
    {"id":"c1-0429","situation":"lead-extended","text":"Notice the irony: the more comfortable the position, the less comfortable {winner} seems with standing still."},
    {"id":"c1-0430","situation":"lead-extended","text":"For {trailer}, the nuisance isn't this setback alone. It's watching the other side collect another season."},
    {"id":"c1-0431","situation":"lead-extended","text":"Protecting an advantage is one thing. Making it inconvenient to pursue is rather better."},
    {"id":"c1-0432","situation":"lead-extended","text":"Another season goes to {winner}, and that carries extra weight when the rivalry already favors you."},
    {"id":"c1-0433","situation":"lead-extended","text":"It's the timing I admire from {leader}. There was room to coast, but not a hint of it here."},
    {"id":"c1-0434","situation":"lead-extended","text":"{loserClub} can be proud of their effort. This round simply leaves them farther behind."},
    {"id":"c1-0435","situation":"lead-extended","text":"You can explain it quite simply: {winnerClub} took this round and made the pursuit harder."},
    {"id":"c1-0436","situation":"lead-extended","text":"That's the practical benefit of winning again. The entire rivalry leans a little farther your way."},
    {"id":"c1-0437","situation":"lead-extended","text":"The real skill isn't sitting in front. It's persuading the pursuer there's still farther to travel."},
    {"id":"c1-0438","situation":"lead-extended","text":"{trailer} cannot undo the earlier rounds now. This one has only increased the work remaining."},
    {"id":"c1-0439","situation":"lead-extended","text":"Remarkably tidy from {winnerClub}. The fresh success reinforces the earlier work."},
    {"id":"c1-0440","situation":"lead-extended","text":"You sense the difference between holding your place and moving the whole Showdown forward."},
    {"id":"c1-0441","situation":"level-overall","text":"Fortunate? Hardly. {managerB} has had to earn that share of the overall contest."},
    {"id":"c1-0442","situation":"level-overall","text":"Imagine asking both dugouts for a leader. The standings wouldn't back either answer."},
    {"id":"c1-0443","situation":"level-overall","text":"That's a proper rivalry, isn't it? Different routes through the seasons, exactly the same place overall."},
    {"id":"c1-0444","situation":"level-overall","text":"My reading is simple. You can't claim superiority that the full standings won't support."},
    {"id":"c1-0445","situation":"level-overall","text":"Notice what the table doesn't offer {managerA}: an excuse to look down on the other dugout."},
    {"id":"c1-0446","situation":"level-overall","text":"With {points} each overall, the argument about who leads has a wonderfully short answer: neither."},
    {"id":"c1-0447","situation":"level-overall","text":"The trick for {managerB} is accepting a share of the spotlight without pretending the other half is empty."},
    {"id":"c1-0448","situation":"level-overall","text":"An accountant might enjoy this balance. A former player wonders which camp can ever feel entirely satisfied."},
    {"id":"c1-0449","situation":"level-overall","text":"It's a wonderfully awkward outcome for {managerB}, all that competitive pride with nowhere to claim overall superiority."},
    {"id":"c1-0450","situation":"level-overall","text":"From where {managerB} stands, the other dugout contains a rival, not a subordinate."},
    {"id":"c1-0451","situation":"level-overall","text":"Funny how a season ends and the long argument simply lands back in the middle."},
    {"id":"c1-0452","situation":"level-overall","text":"Try claiming top billing with identical totals. {managerA} will know why that argument falls flat."},
    {"id":"c1-0453","situation":"level-overall","text":"Look beyond the individual seasons and there's a delicious problem. Nobody sits above the other overall."},
    {"id":"c1-0454","situation":"level-overall","text":"For {managerB}, an equal total is a foothold, not a crown. {managerA} can stand there too."},
    {"id":"c1-0455","situation":"level-overall","text":"Calling it a moral victory for either camp would cheat the other one of proper credit."},
    {"id":"c1-0456","situation":"level-overall","text":"Perfectly balanced, that pair, and football doesn't owe us an outright favourite."},
    {"id":"c1-0457","situation":"level-overall","text":"As it stands, neither camp can hang a sign saying 'leaders' above the door."},
    {"id":"c1-0458","situation":"level-overall","text":"Some contests resolve themselves into a pecking order. This one has refused the invitation, and I'm rather glad."},
    {"id":"c1-0459","situation":"level-overall","text":"Don't ask me to separate them when the Showdown itself hasn't managed it."},
    {"id":"c1-0460","situation":"level-overall","text":"Fancy an argument for a winner? {managerA} won't find one in this overall tally."},
    {"id":"c1-0461","situation":"level-overall","text":"Suppose {clubA} asks for top billing. The overall standings won't be persuaded."},
    {"id":"c1-0462","situation":"level-overall","text":"Handing {clubB} the upper hand would be generous, considering its rival has precisely as many points."},
    {"id":"c1-0463","situation":"level-overall","text":"{managerA} and {managerB} have reached parity, which is sometimes harder to live with than a lead."},
    {"id":"c1-0464","situation":"level-overall","text":"Take the tape measure to the full contest and there's simply no distance between the managers."},
    {"id":"c1-0465","situation":"level-overall","text":"{managerB} deserves pride, not precedence. A former player learns to respect that sort of distinction."},
    {"id":"c1-0466","situation":"level-overall","text":"That's the trouble with shared standing: every boast needs a footnote acknowledging the other manager."},
    {"id":"c1-0467","situation":"level-overall","text":"There's a difference between no winner and no story. This contest is providing plenty of story."},
    {"id":"c1-0468","situation":"level-overall","text":"{clubA} might have its favourite chapters, but the book still gives {clubB} equal space."},
    {"id":"c1-0469","situation":"level-overall","text":"We've arrived at the only verdict these totals permit: evenly matched, without a rightful leader."},
    {"id":"c1-0470","situation":"level-overall","text":"If you find a superior total for {managerA}, do let me know. I've looked and there's nothing there."},
    {"id":"c1-0471","situation":"level-overall","text":"No need for a dramatic verdict from me. The managers are level, and that speaks loudly enough."},
    {"id":"c1-0472","situation":"level-overall","text":"{managerA} can take satisfaction from parity, but {managerB} has exactly the same right to it."},
    {"id":"c1-0473","situation":"level-overall","text":"When {clubA} and {clubB} land on identical overall totals, there isn't much room for bragging."},
    {"id":"c1-0474","situation":"level-overall","text":"Here's the interesting part for {managerA}: neither manager has an overall edge to protect."},
    {"id":"c1-0475","situation":"level-overall","text":"You can dress up {points} apiece however you like, but there is no separation in the overall standings."},
    {"id":"c1-0476","situation":"level-overall","text":"The standings have played the diplomat this time. Neither manager can honestly argue with the overall position."},
    {"id":"c1-0477","situation":"level-overall","text":"With {clubA}, the point isn't to borrow anyone's credit. The full account gives each camp its due."},
    {"id":"c1-0478","situation":"level-overall","text":"It says plenty that {managerA} and {managerB} can stand beside the same overall total without anyone stepping down."},
    {"id":"c1-0479","situation":"level-overall","text":"{clubB} has earned a place at the same height as its rival. That's not second best."},
    {"id":"c1-0480","situation":"level-overall","text":"Neither {clubA} nor {clubB} can lean on reputation now. The full standing won't favour either badge."},
    {"id":"c1-0481","situation":"winning-streak","text":"{winner} has kept finding the right answer each season, and that takes more than a good spell."},
    {"id":"c1-0482","situation":"winning-streak","text":"Momentum isn't an heirloom. {winner} has had to claim the season prize all over again."},
    {"id":"c1-0483","situation":"winning-streak","text":"What {loser} is up against is no brief flourish. The rival's high standards have lasted across seasons."},
    {"id":"c1-0484","situation":"winning-streak","text":"Different seasons, same successful manager. That is a fair description of the standards {winner} has set."},
    {"id":"c1-0485","situation":"winning-streak","text":"Old triumphs don't pay out in a new season, so the continued sequence has genuine weight."},
    {"id":"c1-0486","situation":"winning-streak","text":"Of course {winner} will enjoy this result, but the preparation for repeated success is the real achievement."},
    {"id":"c1-0487","situation":"winning-streak","text":"Apparently the seasonal winner's chair fits {winner} rather comfortably, though nobody has reserved it permanently."},
    {"id":"c1-0488","situation":"winning-streak","text":"Funny how the slate gets wiped before every season, yet {winner} still reaches that familiar conclusion."},
    {"id":"c1-0489","situation":"winning-streak","text":"I've never seen a season honour become boring, but {winner} is certainly testing the theory."},
    {"id":"c1-0490","situation":"winning-streak","text":"Not every tradition is ancient. Some begin when a manager keeps winning the season."},
    {"id":"c1-0491","situation":"winning-streak","text":"Most managers would happily frame a season victory. A sequence like this creates a rather serious wall space problem."},
    {"id":"c1-0492","situation":"winning-streak","text":"I'd hate to be the engraver of seasonal winners. {winner} has been giving that chisel a workout."},
    {"id":"c1-0493","situation":"winning-streak","text":"At least the announcer hasn't needed to learn a different name for the season honours lately."},
    {"id":"c1-0494","situation":"winning-streak","text":"The unexpected outcome would now be a season that ended without {winner} at the top."},
    {"id":"c1-0495","situation":"winning-streak","text":"Watch what this does to a rivalry. Each season starts with the question of whether {winner} can be caught."},
    {"id":"c1-0496","situation":"winning-streak","text":"With this result, {winnerClub} have stitched an extra panel into an already impressive run of seasons."},
    {"id":"c1-0497","situation":"winning-streak","text":"When the seasons are recalled, this unbroken sequence will be harder to overlook than any single victory."},
    {"id":"c1-0498","situation":"winning-streak","text":"Here is what sets the run apart, no past victory could win the latest season for {winner}."},
    {"id":"c1-0499","situation":"winning-streak","text":"There is no shame for {loser} in facing a rival whose season victories have become a formidable habit."},
    {"id":"c1-0500","situation":"winning-streak","text":"Staying in front for successive seasons demands fresh standards, and {winnerClub} keep meeting them."},
    {"id":"c1-0501","situation":"winning-streak","text":"There is a difference between winning once and making it a habit, as {winner} is demonstrating."},
    {"id":"c1-0502","situation":"winning-streak","text":"Every campaign brings its own demands, yet the season victories keep going to {winner}."},
    {"id":"c1-0503","situation":"winning-streak","text":"Quite a run from {winnerClub}, and the impressive part is how often the outcome remains familiar."},
    {"id":"c1-0504","situation":"winning-streak","text":"Consistency sounds rather dull until you're the manager trying to reproduce a winning season."},
    {"id":"c1-0505","situation":"winning-streak","text":"Successive season wins suggest {winner} understands the difference between a breakthrough and a standard."},
    {"id":"c1-0506","situation":"winning-streak","text":"Nobody gets a winning campaign on reputation, however often {winner} has managed it before."},
    {"id":"c1-0507","situation":"winning-streak","text":"Maintaining that edge is harder than finding it, and {winnerClub} have done the difficult part repeatedly."},
    {"id":"c1-0508","situation":"winning-streak","text":"With {winner} taking the latest verdict, the previous victories begin to look like a genuine foundation."},
    {"id":"c1-0509","situation":"winning-streak","text":"Repeatedly getting the better overall return takes application, and {winner} is supplying it."},
    {"id":"c1-0510","situation":"winning-streak","text":"Keeping a streak alive means answering the latest challenge, not admiring the previous result."},
    {"id":"c1-0511","situation":"winning-streak","text":"A sustained run rarely happens by accident, and {winnerClub} are giving us further evidence of that."},
    {"id":"c1-0512","situation":"winning-streak","text":"Expectations follow {winner} into each new season now. Meeting them again is what makes this impressive."},
    {"id":"c1-0513","situation":"winning-streak","text":"Remarkable, really, that {winner} has turned a difficult annual task into something people now half expect."},
    {"id":"c1-0514","situation":"winning-streak","text":"Those victories belong to separate campaigns, and {winner} has found a way through each one."},
    {"id":"c1-0515","situation":"winning-streak","text":"As a rival, a defeat can be shrugged off. A sequence like {winner}'s asks a more serious response."},
    {"id":"c1-0516","situation":"winning-streak","text":"There are no free renewals on a season victory, yet {winnerClub} keep making good on theirs."},
    {"id":"c1-0517","situation":"winning-streak","text":"One season can flatter a manager, but several consecutive successes give {winner} a stronger case."},
    {"id":"c1-0518","situation":"winning-streak","text":"Give {loser} credit for staying in the contest. It's the repeated seasonal victories that make the task demanding."},
    {"id":"c1-0519","situation":"winning-streak","text":"Nothing carries over automatically except the expectation, and {winner} has handled that rather well."},
    {"id":"c1-0520","situation":"winning-streak","text":"Making a sequence last means beginning each season with yesterday's expectations still waiting at the door."},
    {"id":"c1-0521","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Admire the sustained excellence of {loser}, certainly, but the recognition this season belongs to {winner}."},
    {"id":"c1-0522","situation":"streak-broken","text":"What {winnerClub} have done is halt a habit that was beginning to look rather permanent."},
    {"id":"c1-0523","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Keep {loser}'s earlier achievements in view, because they tell you just how much this interruption is worth."},
    {"id":"c1-0524","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Perhaps the telling part is that {winner} beat a rival who knew exactly how to keep winning."},
    {"id":"c1-0525","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Whatever else you take from it, a margin of {margin} has finally interrupted that extraordinary run of season wins."},
    {"id":"c1-0526","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Every completed season offers a chance to contest the pecking order, and this chance has been seized."},
    {"id":"c1-0527","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Remember the difficulty of repeated success, then remember the achievement of the manager who finally interrupts it."},
    {"id":"c1-0528","situation":"streak-broken","text":"There was an established rhythm to these season results, and this time it has changed completely."},
    {"id":"c1-0529","situation":"streak-broken","text":"To {winner}, a season triumph matters, but making the serial winner taste defeat is something else."},
    {"id":"c1-0530","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Somebody finally unplugged the repeat button, and that earlier broadcast had been rather popular until now."},
    {"id":"c1-0531","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Suddenly the script needs a fresh page, and {winnerClub} have supplied the unexpected closing scene."},
    {"id":"c1-0532","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Surely somebody told {winnerClub} the old order was comfortable, and they chose to disturb it anyway."},
    {"id":"c1-0533","situation":"streak-broken","text":"As far as {winnerClub} are concerned, the ending had become repetitive, and they've given it new life."},
    {"id":"c1-0534","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Apparently even a seemingly permanent place at the summit is only rented until the next season ends."},
    {"id":"c1-0535","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Maybe the best compliment to {winner} is that the previous manager had made this look almost impossible."},
    {"id":"c1-0536","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Beneath this season's verdict, a remarkable stretch of uninterrupted victories has reached its limit."},
    {"id":"c1-0537","situation":"streak-broken","text":"What started as an opportunity has become a victory with a longer echo for {winnerClub}."},
    {"id":"c1-0538","situation":"streak-broken","text":"That's an interruption with real substance, and {loser} will understand its significance better than most."},
    {"id":"c1-0539","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Credit {winnerClub}, they have interrupted a formidable sequence without diminishing what came before it."},
    {"id":"c1-0540","situation":"streak-broken","text":"That is a proper answer from {winner}, measured against somebody who had made winning seasons a habit."},
    {"id":"c1-0541","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Notice how {winner} has replaced a predictable season verdict with a very welcome question for the favorite."},
    {"id":"c1-0542","situation":"streak-broken","text":"A series that once seemed to belong to {loser} has become a contest again, thanks to {winnerClub}."},
    {"id":"c1-0543","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Beating {loser} after so many successful seasons carries a particular weight, even without extra ceremony."},
    {"id":"c1-0544","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Eventually a winning spell meets a rival who has learned enough to end it, and here we are."},
    {"id":"c1-0545","situation":"streak-broken","text":"This one belongs to {winner}, but the earlier seasons explain why it carries far more weight than usual."},
    {"id":"c1-0546","situation":"streak-broken","text":"There is no need to diminish {loser}, because that long stretch of success makes this turn impressive."},
    {"id":"c1-0547","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Even the most established pecking order can be challenged, and this season somebody has successfully done it."},
    {"id":"c1-0548","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Set {winnerPoints} against {loserPoints}, and the reversal becomes official after so many seasons favoring {loserClub}."},
    {"id":"c1-0549","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Quite a shift for {winner}, no longer waiting for the established winner to relinquish a season."},
    {"id":"c1-0550","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Consider the pressure on {winner}, knowing a good season alone would not change the story without winning it."},
    {"id":"c1-0551","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Same contest, new victor, and the established assumption has been relieved of its duties."},
    {"id":"c1-0552","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Look at {winnerClub} now, not just victorious but responsible for closing a remarkable chapter of dominance."},
    {"id":"c1-0553","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Against {loserClub}, even an ordinary season triumph demands extra perspective after that long spell of success."},
    {"id":"c1-0554","situation":"streak-broken","text":"A monopoly on season victories sounds secure only until someone decides to challenge the ownership."},
    {"id":"c1-0555","situation":"streak-broken","text":"It took {winner} to change the headline, after {loser} had occupied it for so long."},
    {"id":"c1-0556","situation":"streak-broken","text":"From {winnerClub}'s point of view, the greatest reward may be ending that expectation of another rival success."},
    {"id":"c1-0557","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Previous seasons gave {loser} a strong claim to consistency, but this season belongs elsewhere."},
    {"id":"c1-0558","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Nothing about the old success becomes smaller because {winner} has finally broken through."},
    {"id":"c1-0559","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Right there is the value of persistence, with {winner} finally cutting through the expectation of defeat."},
    {"id":"c1-0560","situation":"streak-broken","text":"Even {loser} will know that a streak is only as long as its latest successful season."},
    {"id":"c1-0561","situation":"opening-season","text":"That opening verdict belongs to {winner}, though {loser} has plenty of the contest left to answer it."},
    {"id":"c1-0562","situation":"opening-season","text":"Quite a way to introduce yourself, {winnerClub}, although introductions don't win the rest of an argument."},
    {"id":"c1-0563","situation":"opening-season","text":"You can prepare for a rivalry all you like, but the first completed season gives it proper shape."},
    {"id":"c1-0564","situation":"opening-season","text":"There is a difference between setting out your intentions and banking a season victory, as {winner} knows now."},
    {"id":"c1-0565","situation":"opening-season","text":"Here's the thing about starting well, you set an expectation that can become as demanding as a deficit."},
    {"id":"c1-0566","situation":"opening-season","text":"There'll be talk about momentum, but at this stage I'd settle for calling it a useful beginning."},
    {"id":"c1-0567","situation":"opening-season","text":"You'd rather be the manager being pursued, and {winner} has arranged exactly that at the outset."},
    {"id":"c1-0568","situation":"opening-season","text":"{loser} hasn't lost the argument, only the opening exchange, and that is worth remembering."},
    {"id":"c1-0569","situation":"opening-season","text":"An early result can shape the mood for ages, and {loserClub} will want to change that mood."},
    {"id":"c1-0570","situation":"opening-season","text":"I suspect {winner} would prefer another season victory to any amount of early applause."},
    {"id":"c1-0571","situation":"opening-season","text":"{loser} can use that opening gap as a measuring stick, rather than treating it as a personal verdict."},
    {"id":"c1-0572","situation":"opening-season","text":"Think of this initial victory as an achievement, not a family heirloom. It still needs looking after."},
    {"id":"c1-0573","situation":"opening-season","text":"That's the first piece of evidence in the case, and {winner} can feel good about presenting it."},
    {"id":"c1-0574","situation":"opening-season","text":"You can't order success in bulk, {winner}, just because the first delivery arrived. That's football."},
    {"id":"c1-0575","situation":"opening-season","text":"Don't make {loser} carry this setback around forever. There are better uses for a lesson."},
    {"id":"c1-0576","situation":"opening-season","text":"Taking the opening loss is unpleasant for {loser}. Treating it as the final word would be a bigger mistake."},
    {"id":"c1-0577","situation":"opening-season","text":"Don't confuse the opening pace with the finishing order, even if {winner} has every right to celebrate it."},
    {"id":"c1-0578","situation":"opening-season","text":"First impressions can be corrected, though {winnerClub} would quite like this one to become permanent."},
    {"id":"c1-0579","situation":"opening-season","text":"No sense reading the entire future from this result, but you'd certainly prefer to be {winner}."},
    {"id":"c1-0580","situation":"opening-season","text":"Enjoy the early advantage, by all means, but the next challenge won't be won by nostalgia."},
    {"id":"c1-0581","situation":"opening-season","text":"Fair play to {loser}, there are worse ways to begin a rivalry than with a challenge worth answering."},
    {"id":"c1-0582","situation":"opening-season","text":"My advice to {winnerClub} would be to frame the opening lead, not get too comfortable admiring it."},
    {"id":"c1-0583","situation":"opening-season","text":"Early success deserves appreciation, but it doesn't need a commemorative plaque just yet."},
    {"id":"c1-0584","situation":"opening-season","text":"We're finally judging what's been achieved, not what anyone hoped would happen. A welcome change."},
    {"id":"c1-0585","situation":"opening-season","text":"I wouldn't commission a statue on this evidence. I'd certainly acknowledge a very capable beginning."},
    {"id":"c1-0586","situation":"opening-season","text":"Nobody wins a lasting argument in the opening chapter, but {winner} has certainly chosen the subject."},
    {"id":"c1-0587","situation":"opening-season","text":"Confidence follows a decent beginning, but {winnerClub} won't find a guarantee attached to the result."},
    {"id":"c1-0588","situation":"opening-season","text":"An early setback can be useful to {loser}, if more energy goes into responding than explaining it."},
    {"id":"c1-0589","situation":"opening-season","text":"Bragging rights are lovely, but you'll notice they don't defend themselves when the next comparison arrives."},
    {"id":"c1-0590","situation":"opening-season","text":"Comfort belongs to {winner} for now. The other manager has a fresh reason to get back to work."},
    {"id":"c1-0591","situation":"opening-season","text":"I'd leave {winnerClub}'s cabinet shut for now, because opening honors aren't the same thing as a finished Showdown."},
    {"id":"c1-0592","situation":"opening-season","text":"For {loserClub}, the task changes immediately, but the season just finished is not the whole story."},
    {"id":"c1-0593","situation":"opening-season","text":"Early credit is earned, not borrowed. That's the pleasing thing about {winner}'s first result."},
    {"id":"c1-0594","situation":"opening-season","text":"Consider that our opening reference point. Future campaigns will have to live with it."},
    {"id":"c1-0595","situation":"opening-season","text":"Good starts are useful, though {winner} will know the next campaign asks the question all over again."},
    {"id":"c1-0596","situation":"opening-season","text":"Banked points won't lose value just because {winnerClub} earned them before the rivalry had much history."},
    {"id":"c1-0597","situation":"opening-season","text":"Suddenly the screen has an order, and that order already comes with a story worth telling."},
    {"id":"c1-0598","situation":"opening-season","text":"I'd enjoy the applause if I were {winner}, but I'd also ask how repeatable that advantage really is."},
    {"id":"c1-0599","situation":"opening-season","text":"There's a pleasant luxury to starting in front, you don't need permission to enjoy it."},
    {"id":"c1-0600","situation":"opening-season","text":"Odd thing about early rankings, they matter immediately yet remain entirely open to challenge."},
    {"id":"c1-0601","situation":"halfway","text":"Halfway through, and {leader} has the advantage. The rest of this argument is still wonderfully unsettled."},
    {"id":"c1-0602","situation":"halfway","text":"Being in front suits {leader} nicely, especially when the alternative involves explaining why you're chasing."},
    {"id":"c1-0603","situation":"halfway","text":"You can admire {leader}'s work without engraving a trophy just yet. I'd leave the chisel in its box."},
    {"id":"c1-0604","situation":"halfway","text":"Even this panel can't agree which way the Showdown swings after the turn. We're hardly helping, are we?"},
    {"id":"c1-0605","situation":"halfway","text":"We're at the midpoint, not the medal ceremony. Someone ought to remind the imaginary engraver."},
    {"id":"c1-0606","situation":"halfway","text":"Imagine giving {trailer} the final say already. It would be a dreadful waste of the remaining seasons."},
    {"id":"c1-0607","situation":"halfway","text":"My advice to {trailer}? Keep the competitive streak sharp and the concession speech buried under the sofa."},
    {"id":"c1-0608","situation":"halfway","text":"Those early chapters have substance. The ending remains out of reach, despite our magnificent confidence."},
    {"id":"c1-0609","situation":"halfway","text":"Would I rather be {leader}? Absolutely. Would I bet the sofa on it? Absolutely not."},
    {"id":"c1-0610","situation":"halfway","text":"Put the champagne jokes away. This break is for comparing notes, not choosing where the cup sits."},
    {"id":"c1-0611","situation":"halfway","text":"Archive the opening act if you like. The next part needs someone bold enough to write it."},
    {"id":"c1-0612","situation":"halfway","text":"Give me an unruly finish over a tidy prediction any day. Predictability makes dreadful television."},
    {"id":"c1-0613","situation":"halfway","text":"A checkpoint isn't a result to frame. It's where the frame starts looking too small for the story."},
    {"id":"c1-0614","situation":"halfway","text":"The balance currently favours {leader}. That's a sentence, not the full newspaper edition."},
    {"id":"c1-0615","situation":"halfway","text":"Offer {trailer} the courtesy of a contest far from settled. Predictions can wait until the closing scene."},
    {"id":"c1-0616","situation":"halfway","text":"Best thing about this review? We can disagree loudly without a single one of us being proved right."},
    {"id":"c1-0617","situation":"halfway","text":"What we have here is a proper interval, enough evidence for debate and nowhere near enough for certainty."},
    {"id":"c1-0618","situation":"halfway","text":"We can settle the intermission debate once it's finished. Until then, all opinions remain pleasantly vulnerable."},
    {"id":"c1-0619","situation":"halfway","text":"Genuine merit in {leader}'s position, genuine danger in confusing it with a coronation."},
    {"id":"c1-0620","situation":"halfway","text":"I wouldn't change places with {leader}, but I wouldn't order the commemorative plaque either."},
    {"id":"c1-0621","situation":"halfway","text":"The studio has its favourites and its doubts. This pause gives both enough oxygen to keep arguing."},
    {"id":"c1-0622","situation":"halfway","text":"There is still room for {trailer} to answer, and that's what makes the middle of a contest fascinating."},
    {"id":"c1-0623","situation":"halfway","text":"Taking stock is all very well. What matters is whether your habits survive the business end of the Showdown."},
    {"id":"c1-0624","situation":"halfway","text":"Credit {winnerClub} for coming this far with purpose. Getting home is quite another assignment."},
    {"id":"c1-0625","situation":"halfway","text":"Keeping the advantage will tell us more about {leader} than winning it in the first place ever could."},
    {"id":"c1-0626","situation":"halfway","text":"Predicting the ending from here would be rather like leaving a match at half time to write the report."},
    {"id":"c1-0627","situation":"halfway","text":"With {trailer}, the challenge isn't to rewrite the past. It's to give the closing chapters a new direction."},
    {"id":"c1-0628","situation":"halfway","text":"By now the strengths are familiar. The real examination is whether they hold when the prize comes into view."},
    {"id":"c1-0629","situation":"halfway","text":"Wise managers use this pause to find the cracks, not to admire the paintwork."},
    {"id":"c1-0630","situation":"halfway","text":"A result like this gives {winner} momentum, not a holiday from everything still to be done."},
    {"id":"c1-0631","situation":"halfway","text":"Granted, {leader} would choose this position gladly. That doesn't make the closing duties optional."},
    {"id":"c1-0632","situation":"halfway","text":"Having a lead at the midpoint is preferable to chasing, provided you remember nobody awards it early."},
    {"id":"c1-0633","situation":"halfway","text":"Patience matters to {trailer}, because a reckless chase can squander a perfectly genuine chance."},
    {"id":"c1-0634","situation":"halfway","text":"Perhaps the nicest thing about this checkpoint is discovering that your rival still has questions for you."},
    {"id":"c1-0635","situation":"halfway","text":"Promising form gets you to this point. Repeating it is what makes the closing stretch interesting."},
    {"id":"c1-0636","situation":"halfway","text":"Don't be fooled by a familiar pecking order. For {leader}, the difficult part may be what follows."},
    {"id":"c1-0637","situation":"halfway","text":"Experienced managers know the pause can be misleading. It's easier to inspect the standings than improve them."},
    {"id":"c1-0638","situation":"halfway","text":"Nothing's decided, but there are fewer chances to make a poor choice look harmless from this point onward."},
    {"id":"c1-0639","situation":"halfway","text":"I suspect {trailer} would gladly trade a tidy explanation for a better answer in the coming seasons."},
    {"id":"c1-0640","situation":"halfway","text":"We've reached the turn, and the rivalry has at least told both managers what kind of answer will be required."},
    {"id":"c1-0641","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"Anyone calling this settled has mistaken a useful lead for the finished article."},
    {"id":"c1-0642","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"Look at {leader}'s task: protect what's been built without becoming afraid to build further."},
    {"id":"c1-0643","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"That cushion beside {leader}'s name matters, yet it can't do the managing on its own."},
    {"id":"c1-0644","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"It's an unusual kind of pressure, knowing the next chapter cannot simply be followed by another."},
    {"id":"c1-0645","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"In the end, all those previous seasons have brought us to an open door."},
    {"id":"c1-0646","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"{trailer} gets to challenge the order of things, which makes this anything but a formality."},
    {"id":"c1-0647","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"{trailer} won't be rescued by what came before, but isn't condemned by it either."},
    {"id":"c1-0648","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"This is where planning stops sounding clever and starts having to produce something tangible."},
    {"id":"c1-0649","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"For once, the excitement lies entirely in what hasn't happened yet."},
    {"id":"c1-0650","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"And {trailer} knows a bold response only matters if it lasts beyond the opening excitement."},
    {"id":"c1-0651","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"There's no requirement for {trailer} to look comfortable, only to make a proper challenge."},
    {"id":"c1-0652","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"Give {trailer} credit for still having a route into the conversation that matters most."},
    {"id":"c1-0653","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"Picture {trailer} studying the challenge, not because it's pleasant, but because it's still possible."},
    {"id":"c1-0654","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"Now {leader} has to make experience count without assuming experience settles anything."},
    {"id":"c1-0655","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"Neither {trailer} nor the rest of us knows the answer, which is entirely the point."},
    {"id":"c1-0656","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"We're at the stage where every future achievement could alter the shape of the whole contest."},
    {"id":"c1-0657","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"All that separates {leader} from the answer is the season that hasn't happened yet. Lovely pressure, that."},
    {"id":"c1-0658","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"Unfashionable thought, perhaps, but {trailer} could yet make the favourite a footnote rather than the headline."},
    {"id":"c1-0659","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"On the studio chalkboard, {leader} occupies the top line. The bottom line hasn't been written."},
    {"id":"c1-0660","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"Naturally, the schedule saved its most inconvenient appointment for last, the one that decides the lot."},
    {"id":"c1-0661","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"I trust {leader} has kept the presentation-case receipt. There remains the small matter of a final campaign."},
    {"id":"c1-0662","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"Apparently we've reached the part where the pundits become less useful and the managers become more interesting."},
    {"id":"c1-0663","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"Put the headline in pencil, please. Ink deserves to wait for a decision the contest hasn't made."},
    {"id":"c1-0664","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"Of course our pundits want closure. They're the only people here paid to sound certain before the evidence arrives."},
    {"id":"c1-0665","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"It's a rare pleasure to watch the analysts run out of ways to say 'I think' and mean 'I know'."},
    {"id":"c1-0666","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"Let the engraver finish their tea. The name won't be decided by who shouts loudest in here."},
    {"id":"c1-0667","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"There's a full stop waiting at the end of this rivalry. It would be rude to print it early."},
    {"id":"c1-0668","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"Here is the peculiar thing about {leader}'s position: so close to the prize, and still far from certainty."},
    {"id":"c1-0669","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"No more future campaigns to soften the outcome. The next season will give this contest its final shape."},
    {"id":"c1-0670","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"A long campaign can hide its sharpest turn in the very last bend. We've reached that bend."},
    {"id":"c1-0671","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"Call it the threshold, not the destination. {leader} still has to see this contest through."},
    {"id":"c1-0672","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"Some campaigns furnish a cabinet. This next one decides which manager gets to close the book."},
    {"id":"c1-0673","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"Respect the story so far. The closing installment still has power to rearrange the whole shelf."},
    {"id":"c1-0674","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"Being at the front gives {leader} a luxury and a headache: the target is impossible to miss."},
    {"id":"c1-0675","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"If this rivalry were a book, the last page would be the one everybody keeps trying to peek at."},
    {"id":"c1-0676","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"We've reached the climax without reaching a conclusion. For once, those aren't quite the same thing."},
    {"id":"c1-0677","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"Sound engineer, save the triumphant sting. We haven't earned the right to choose whose entrance it accompanies."},
    {"id":"c1-0678","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"Consider the difference between a favourite and a champion: a season that still needs playing."},
    {"id":"c1-0679","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"I enjoy a premature verdict as much as any pundit, but this particular one would age terribly."},
    {"id":"c1-0680","situation":"final-season-decider","text":"My cue cards say 'certain winner'. The production team wisely left the name blank."},
    {"id":"c1-0681","situation":"showdown-won","text":"Credit {loser} with a challenge worth overcoming. A title means more when the opposition has earned respect."},
    {"id":"c1-0682","situation":"showdown-won","text":"I'd say {winner} has earned the privilege of being mildly insufferable about this over dinner."},
    {"id":"c1-0683","situation":"showdown-won","text":"Nobody can take the best memories from either dugout. The final difference of {margin} belongs to the champion."},
    {"id":"c1-0684","situation":"showdown-won","text":"That's the thing people overlook, you can own a wonderful chapter without owning the book."},
    {"id":"c1-0685","situation":"showdown-won","text":"Try winning a single season and you get applause. Win the entire thing and you get the bragging rights."},
    {"id":"c1-0686","situation":"showdown-won","text":"Careful with any jokes at {loser}'s expense. A worthy opponent makes the achievement matter."},
    {"id":"c1-0687","situation":"showdown-won","text":"{loser} made the winner work for the recognition, which makes this a proper sporting finish."},
    {"id":"c1-0688","situation":"showdown-won","text":"If you're {loserClub}, you'll want another opportunity. That's the attitude that gives a rivalry its future."},
    {"id":"c1-0689","situation":"showdown-won","text":"Nice to see {winner} with {margin} to spare at the finish. That's more satisfying than a promising position."},
    {"id":"c1-0690","situation":"showdown-won","text":"If you ask {loser}, they'll likely recall favorite moments. {winner} can settle for the overall honor."},
    {"id":"c1-0691","situation":"showdown-won","text":"Some trophies look grand in a picture. {winner} has claimed something better, an answer to the whole challenge."},
    {"id":"c1-0692","situation":"showdown-won","text":"I'll give {loser} this much, their contribution shouldn't vanish because a rival got the celebration."},
    {"id":"c1-0693","situation":"showdown-won","text":"Hardly the time for a long explanation. A title across the entire competition explains itself."},
    {"id":"c1-0694","situation":"showdown-won","text":"After the closing whistle, there isn't another step on the ladder. You can only look at who finished highest."},
    {"id":"c1-0695","situation":"showdown-won","text":"Try choosing a favorite memory if you like. {winnerPoints} to {loserPoints} is how the campaign is judged."},
    {"id":"c1-0696","situation":"showdown-won","text":"A trophy shelf has room for memories, but this is the sort of honor that deserves its own space."},
    {"id":"c1-0697","situation":"showdown-won","text":"{winnerClub} takes the contest by {margin} overall. Individual seasons had their turns, and now comes the bigger honor."},
    {"id":"c1-0698","situation":"showdown-won","text":"{loserClub} hasn't claimed the title, but its place in a serious rivalry is beyond question."},
    {"id":"c1-0699","situation":"showdown-won","text":"{loser} can take the final laugh, if they like. {winner} has rather more to smile about."},
    {"id":"c1-0700","situation":"showdown-won","text":"I'd leave space on the shelf, because {winner} has earned something worth displaying."},
    {"id":"c1-0701","situation":"showdown-won","text":"{loserClub} still has plenty of reasons to compete again. That's how a rivalry keeps its appeal."},
    {"id":"c1-0702","situation":"showdown-won","text":"Rather than prepare a speech, {winner} could just frame {winnerPoints} to {loserPoints}. Efficient, really."},
    {"id":"c1-0703","situation":"showdown-won","text":"{loser} hasn't been written out of the story. Their challenge is part of what made it memorable."},
    {"id":"c1-0704","situation":"showdown-won","text":"{winner} can be generous in victory. That shouldn't be difficult with the title safely secured."},
    {"id":"c1-0705","situation":"showdown-won","text":"{loserClub} has reason to come back with ambition. A gracious ending doesn't mean the rivalry is finished."},
    {"id":"c1-0706","situation":"showdown-won","text":"And that's it, really. {winnerPoints} to {loserPoints}, and {winner} can take a deserved bow."},
    {"id":"c1-0707","situation":"showdown-won","text":"Give {winner} the title, and give {loser} some credit for making the contest matter."},
    {"id":"c1-0708","situation":"showdown-won","text":"That debate's officially finished. I shall miss sounding certain while being so regularly unsure."},
    {"id":"c1-0709","situation":"showdown-won","text":"Goodbye to the ifs, the maybes and the hopeful little asterisks. We've arrived at the answer."},
    {"id":"c1-0710","situation":"showdown-won","text":"Turns out the most convincing pundit wasn't sitting here at all. It was the finished standings."},
    {"id":"c1-0711","situation":"showdown-won","text":"For {loserClub}, a worthy rivalry to look back on. For {winnerClub}, a title to treasure."},
    {"id":"c1-0712","situation":"showdown-won","text":"If {winner} needs an introduction now, just use the word champion. Saves everyone a lot of time."},
    {"id":"c1-0713","situation":"showdown-won","text":"Our congratulations go to {winner}. Our sympathies go to whoever backed the other prediction in this studio."},
    {"id":"c1-0714","situation":"showdown-won","text":"You can debate the route all evening, but {winnerClub} owns the destination. That's the awkward bit for us."},
    {"id":"c1-0715","situation":"showdown-won","text":"Let's have the applause for {winner}, and let's not forget {loser} helped make it worth winning."},
    {"id":"c1-0716","situation":"showdown-won","text":"I'd happily reopen the discussion, but the prize has already been claimed. A minor obstacle for television."},
    {"id":"c1-0717","situation":"showdown-won","text":"You know what's refreshing? No conditional language left. {winner} has won, full stop."},
    {"id":"c1-0718","situation":"showdown-won","text":"There's a difference between enjoying a season and owning the Showdown. We're looking at it now."},
    {"id":"c1-0719","situation":"showdown-won","text":"Nobody should confuse losing a Showdown with having nothing to show for a fine rivalry."},
    {"id":"c1-0720","situation":"showdown-won","text":"My colleague's about to offer nuance. Before that, congratulations to {winner}, who actually won the thing."},
    {"id":"c1-0721","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"{managerB} finishes exactly level overall, and suddenly the loudest person in our studio has gone quiet."},
    {"id":"c1-0722","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"Somebody ordered a championship celebration, and the standings sent back a very polite refusal."},
    {"id":"c1-0723","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"Those closing figures have settled the competition without settling a single studio argument."},
    {"id":"c1-0724","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"So the Showdown closes without a champion. It turns out a shared ending can still make headlines."},
    {"id":"c1-0725","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"Can someone explain how we spent all that time arguing only to finish with a perfectly shared verdict?"},
    {"id":"c1-0726","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"You want a decisive finale? Sorry, the managers have delivered something considerably more awkward for pundits."},
    {"id":"c1-0727","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"Here's the uncomfortable part for our predictions. Both sides were equally right at the end."},
    {"id":"c1-0728","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"Apparently the grand prize today is permission to argue about this rivalry for as long as you like."},
    {"id":"c1-0729","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"Take another look at {clubA}. The overall balance remains exact, even after the last season."},
    {"id":"c1-0730","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"Our panel was promised a final verdict. What we received was a beautifully stubborn dead heat."},
    {"id":"c1-0731","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"Leave the champion's chair empty and fill the studio with theories. What a fitting way for a tie to end."},
    {"id":"c1-0732","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"We could flip a coin, but that would be our game, not the Showdown's result."},
    {"id":"c1-0733","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"The closing credits have rolled, and neither manager's name gets a bigger font."},
    {"id":"c1-0734","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"Let's congratulate the rivalry. It has somehow managed to win the argument against all our predictions."},
    {"id":"c1-0735","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"With a straight face, the finished totals deliver their closing joke. Neither side finishes higher."},
    {"id":"c1-0736","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"Not many finales leave {managerB} with an equal standing and the commentators still searching for a verdict."},
    {"id":"c1-0737","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"Well played to {managerB}, and equally well played to the manager who matched that total."},
    {"id":"c1-0738","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"I'd say {clubA} deserved the overall crown, but the opposition can make the very same case."},
    {"id":"c1-0739","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"Maybe our studio should declare itself drawn as well. We've certainly argued enough to earn it."},
    {"id":"c1-0740","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"We asked for a winner of the whole thing. {managerB} and the opposition supplied a perfect tie."},
    {"id":"c1-0741","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"The result offers {clubA} something better than a boast. A claim its rival can match word for word."},
    {"id":"c1-0742","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"Someone in the studio still wants a winner. {managerA} can direct them straight to the equal totals."},
    {"id":"c1-0743","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"Here's the archive's dilemma. Where do you file {clubA} when the entire Showdown has ended without a sole champion?"},
    {"id":"c1-0744","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"A shared finish for {clubA} sounds modest until you remember the whole rivalry ended that way."},
    {"id":"c1-0745","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"I've got a theory about {managerA}, but the equal standings have spoiled the dramatic conclusion."},
    {"id":"c1-0746","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"At the finish, {clubA} and the opposition have written a joint ending neither can improve upon."},
    {"id":"c1-0747","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"Somebody ask for the simplest headline. {managerA} finishes level, and neither manager can claim the crown."},
    {"id":"c1-0748","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"At the final whistle on this rivalry, {managerA} and {managerB} have equal claims to respect, not the crown."},
    {"id":"c1-0749","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"Put {clubA}'s total beside {clubB}'s and there's your answer. Not much room for boasting, is there?"},
    {"id":"c1-0750","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"Nobody owns the title, though {managerB} might be entitled to a very satisfied shrug. That's fair enough."},
    {"id":"c1-0751","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"The crown stays unclaimed, because {managerB} hasn't finished behind anyone, including {managerA}."},
    {"id":"c1-0752","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"That's a shared result for {clubB}, not an awkward pause while somebody hunts for a missing point."},
    {"id":"c1-0753","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"Both have carried the challenge to its conclusion, and {managerA} has nobody left to overtake."},
    {"id":"c1-0754","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"The champion's chair can stay empty. {managerB} has done quite enough to make the other manager earn a seat beside them."},
    {"id":"c1-0755","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"Anyone expecting {clubB} to edge {clubA} will have to settle for precisely matched totals."},
    {"id":"c1-0756","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"Worth remembering, neither manager has fallen short of the other. The closing standings couldn't be straighter."},
    {"id":"c1-0757","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"If {managerA} feels proud, fair enough. Matching a worthy competitor is an achievement, even without the outright prize."},
    {"id":"c1-0758","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"Every season has contributed to this ending, and {clubB} finds itself level when the last count is made."},
    {"id":"c1-0759","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"Imagine seeing every campaign through, only for {managerA} to discover the gap has vanished altogether."},
    {"id":"c1-0760","situation":"showdown-drawn","text":"A victory speech would be premature. The championship has concluded without anybody earning the right to give it."},
    {"id":"c1-0761","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Oddly, the grandest honour makes a modest gain worth celebrating. Almost, I said almost, like silverware."},
    {"id":"c1-0762","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"There's no shortcut through this one. The gold waits for a manager to earn it alone."},
    {"id":"c1-0763","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Think about {trailer} for a moment. A rival near the summit can be a useful incentive, however unwelcome."},
    {"id":"c1-0764","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Rather telling, isn't it, that {leader} can make an entire campaign feel like part of a larger climb?"},
    {"id":"c1-0765","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"From {trailer}'s viewpoint, a mountain is still climbable. It simply doesn't offer an easier path downhill."},
    {"id":"c1-0766","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Don't confuse {leader}'s advantage with the prize itself. The special finish has its own conditions."},
    {"id":"c1-0767","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Sharing the work won't do here. That top honour recognizes an individual manager's accumulated achievements."},
    {"id":"c1-0768","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Imagine {leader} considering the engraving. I'd keep the pen in its box until the mark is reached."},
    {"id":"c1-0769","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Strange, isn't it? A comfortable lead doesn't get anybody through the entrance marked gold."},
    {"id":"c1-0770","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"A disappointing season for the opponent won't improve your own tally. That's the wonderfully cruel twist here."},
    {"id":"c1-0771","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"I'd call it a test of appetite, not just ability. Can a manager keep coming back for more?"},
    {"id":"c1-0772","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Cabinet space might become an issue, although I'd suggest qualifying for the trophy before ordering furniture."},
    {"id":"c1-0773","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Proper marathon of ambition, this. {trailer} must watch the distance without losing sight of the destination."},
    {"id":"c1-0774","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"That mountain hasn't moved for {trailer}. A perfectly fair test, and a rather exhausting one."},
    {"id":"c1-0775","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Comparison can't carry {leader} over that threshold. Personal points alone do the heavy lifting."},
    {"id":"c1-0776","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Pocket change on the standings can become a fortune when you're saving toward a golden future."},
    {"id":"c1-0777","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"A domestic cup might sparkle, but the biggest distinction demands a whole career's worth of staying power."},
    {"id":"c1-0778","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Trophies come with ribbons. This golden honour might as well include a certificate for sheer stubbornness."},
    {"id":"c1-0779","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Try winning this distinction with charm, and you'd be rich in compliments but desperately short of points."},
    {"id":"c1-0780","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Polish it all you like, the cabinet cannot turn an unfinished pursuit into a completed achievement."},
    {"id":"c1-0781","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Almost is a very expensive word in this contest. {leader} will be wanting to retire it."},
    {"id":"c1-0782","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"And that's the essential truth. The golden honour rewards the manager who arrives, never their combined output."},
    {"id":"c1-0783","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"I'd sell tickets to the argument over who gets to touch that gleaming plinth first."},
    {"id":"c1-0784","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"We've moved from wondering who might shine to wondering who gets their name engraved first."},
    {"id":"c1-0785","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Golden Showdown talk once belonged at the end of the program, not the top of the broadcast."},
    {"id":"c1-0786","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Funny how a bit of gold can make a perfectly friendly rivalry feel wonderfully serious."},
    {"id":"c1-0787","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Quite a promotion, from ordinary contender to the subject of a commemorative cover story."},
    {"id":"c1-0788","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"I'd love to know who first suggested keeping this casual, because that idea has left the building."},
    {"id":"c1-0789","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Would you trust anyone in this studio to guard a golden trophy with this much at stake?"},
    {"id":"c1-0790","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Somewhere between a dream and a decision, this contest has found a rather expensive edge."},
    {"id":"c1-0791","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Let me put it politely, the ordinary trophy cabinet is no longer the main attraction."},
    {"id":"c1-0792","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Engraving the plate is the easy part, earning the first name is another matter entirely."},
    {"id":"c1-0793","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Perhaps the smartest person here is the one who refuses to predict which name goes on the plaque."},
    {"id":"c1-0794","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Every rival needs a mountain worth climbing, and {leader} has made the summit feel very real."},
    {"id":"c1-0795","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Call it the business end, and {trailer} would probably ask for a little more business."},
    {"id":"c1-0796","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Every glittering headline has a quieter footnote, and {trailer}'s role deserves to be written properly."},
    {"id":"c1-0797","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"{leader} has hauled the biggest challenge in this competition into the brightest part of the spotlight."},
    {"id":"c1-0798","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"You could put velvet ropes around {leader}'s achievement, but the questions would still get through."},
    {"id":"c1-0799","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"So here's the question, who can carry the expectation when a special prize comes into focus?"},
    {"id":"c1-0800","situation":"golden-showdown","text":"Please tell the printer to keep the front page flexible, this deserves better than a premature headline."},
    {"id":"c1-0801","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"There goes the whole competition, wrapped up before anyone could ask for a sequel."},
    {"id":"c1-0802","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"Every pundit loves a long-running debate, and {winner} has rather spoiled that business."},
    {"id":"c1-0803","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"Imagine writing a season preview and finding it's also the championship's closing chapter."},
    {"id":"c1-0804","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"Opening statements rarely become closing arguments, but that's exactly what this format demands."},
    {"id":"c1-0805","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"Brief on the calendar, enormous in the memory, this was no minor undertaking."},
    {"id":"c1-0806","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"Somewhere in the studio notes is a prediction for next season, completely useless now."},
    {"id":"c1-0807","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"My favourite part is that nobody can hide behind a promise about later improvements."},
    {"id":"c1-0808","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"Nothing provisional about this verdict, the Showdown belongs to {winner} outright."},
    {"id":"c1-0809","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"That's a whole title settled before the pundits have finished arguing about the opening."},
    {"id":"c1-0810","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"Strange how the shortest format can produce the most definitive conversation in the studio."},
    {"id":"c1-0811","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"We might expect an encore, yet {winner} has already taken the curtain call."},
    {"id":"c1-0812","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"It's almost rude how quickly the title argument has been settled in {winner}'s favour."},
    {"id":"c1-0813","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"Funny, we gave the preview a long discussion and the actual verdict has stolen the whole show."},
    {"id":"c1-0814","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"There are no instalments left to sell, which must upset the studio more than {winner}."},
    {"id":"c1-0815","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"Suppose the panel demanded another chance to judge, the closing page would politely disagree."},
    {"id":"c1-0816","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"For the neutral, more chapters would be lovely, but {winner} has written the ending."},
    {"id":"c1-0817","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"There wasn't time to build a legend gradually, so {winner} chose the direct approach."},
    {"id":"c1-0818","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"There's a whistle in the imagination and a full stop on the page, all at once."},
    {"id":"c1-0819","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"All roads led to this conclusion, even if there was barely any road at all."},
    {"id":"c1-0820","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"I'll admit it, the panel wanted a saga, but {winner} has handed us a final chapter."},
    {"id":"c1-0821","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"Enough of the hypothetical comebacks, this edition has reached its last page."},
    {"id":"c1-0822","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"I'd say {winnerClub} timed it perfectly, except there was only this chance to take."},
    {"id":"c1-0823","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"Try telling {winner} that this title needs another chapter, I think you'll get a grin."},
    {"id":"c1-0824","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"You can spend ages preparing for a rivalry, but {winner} has settled this edition before it could grow old."},
    {"id":"c1-0825","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"It's a bruising sort of finish for {loser}. Not because it was long, but because it wasn't."},
    {"id":"c1-0826","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"No long tour of excuses here. {winnerClub} answered the only question on the card and gets the prize."},
    {"id":"c1-0827","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"I quite like the simplicity. {winner} has done enough, and nobody needs to consult a calendar."},
    {"id":"c1-0828","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"A brief rivalry chapter can leave a surprisingly long argument. {loserClub} may have a few contributions."},
    {"id":"c1-0829","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"Look at {winner} now. A whole Showdown decided with barely enough time for the arguments to warm up."},
    {"id":"c1-0830","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"There was no rehearsal for {loser}. They had to get this right immediately, which is rather unforgiving."},
    {"id":"c1-0831","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"Winning that season has handed {winnerClub} the whole Showdown. That is efficiency worth admiring."},
    {"id":"c1-0832","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"Imagine telling {winner} to pace themselves. There was nowhere further to go after this."},
    {"id":"c1-0833","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"Consider {loserClub}'s predicament. The next campaign might be brilliant, but it cannot alter this edition."},
    {"id":"c1-0834","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"True credit belongs to {winner}. They arrived ready while the format offered no room for adjustments."},
    {"id":"c1-0835","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"There are lessons for {loser}, certainly, though none can change the championship that's just ended."},
    {"id":"c1-0836","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"A sprint isn't necessarily easier. Ask {winner}, who had to make the whole campaign work at once."},
    {"id":"c1-0837","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"What a peculiar pressure on {loserClub}, knowing there was no later season to balance the books."},
    {"id":"c1-0838","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"Some managers like the safety of a long project. {winner} has managed rather well without that safety net."},
    {"id":"c1-0839","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"That's why {winnerClub} will be delighted. No later chapter is going to undo this achievement."},
    {"id":"c1-0840","situation":"one-season-sprint","text":"Notice that {loser} doesn't need to feel diminished. Sometimes the other manager simply makes the opportunity count."},
    {"id":"c1-0841","situation":"dominant-run","text":"You might expect the challenger to catch up eventually. {leader} has made waiting rather uncomfortable."},
    {"id":"c1-0842","situation":"dominant-run","text":"Winning once earns applause. Doing it every time so far gives your rival a rather awkward homework assignment."},
    {"id":"c1-0843","situation":"dominant-run","text":"{loser} has the right to answer back. {leader} hasn't allowed the reply to become a season win yet."},
    {"id":"c1-0844","situation":"dominant-run","text":"Sharing isn't on the agenda for {leader}. Not the seasonal honours, at any rate."},
    {"id":"c1-0845","situation":"dominant-run","text":"Notice how the expectations have shifted. {winner} now carries the burden of being impossible to ignore."},
    {"id":"c1-0846","situation":"dominant-run","text":"For {trailer}, every fresh campaign comes with the same invitation to spoil the pattern."},
    {"id":"c1-0847","situation":"dominant-run","text":"Single victories can flatter a manager. A run of season wins this long is much harder to question."},
    {"id":"c1-0848","situation":"dominant-run","text":"Admire the run, certainly, but leave room for a challenge. The outcome of the next season isn't written."},
    {"id":"c1-0849","situation":"dominant-run","text":"What impresses me isn't just the streak. It's the pressure of carrying it into another season."},
    {"id":"c1-0850","situation":"dominant-run","text":"Nobody hands out a win just for showing up. {leader} has earned every season claimed so far."},
    {"id":"c1-0851","situation":"dominant-run","text":"I rather admire {trailer} for staying in the argument. Nobody said this was meant to be comfortable."},
    {"id":"c1-0852","situation":"dominant-run","text":"{winner} has been first every time we've checked in. The other manager won't need reminding."},
    {"id":"c1-0853","situation":"dominant-run","text":"{loserClub} hasn't won a season yet. That's a problem to solve, not a verdict on the club."},
    {"id":"c1-0854","situation":"dominant-run","text":"One victory might be explained away. A whole sequence asks us to give {leader} proper credit."},
    {"id":"c1-0855","situation":"dominant-run","text":"It looks effortless from here, doesn't it? I'd wager {winner} knows better than anyone what it takes."},
    {"id":"c1-0856","situation":"dominant-run","text":"{trailer} can take comfort in one thing. A run can be broken, even one as stubborn as this."},
    {"id":"c1-0857","situation":"dominant-run","text":"Funny thing, success eventually stops surprising people. {leader} has made a win feel almost routine."},
    {"id":"c1-0858","situation":"dominant-run","text":"To beat a run, you've got to start somewhere. {trailer} hasn't found that starting place yet."},
    {"id":"c1-0859","situation":"dominant-run","text":"Possession of all the season wins belongs to {leader}, not the rights to the next one."},
    {"id":"c1-0860","situation":"dominant-run","text":"Careful before declaring the future settled. A spotless run is not the same as a promise."},
    {"id":"c1-0861","situation":"dominant-run","text":"Hard to find an argument against this form, isn't it? Every available season has ended in victory."},
    {"id":"c1-0862","situation":"dominant-run","text":"Would I call {leader} unbeatable? Certainly not. But nobody has managed a season win against them yet."},
    {"id":"c1-0863","situation":"dominant-run","text":"Even after this much success, the next season remains a proper question. That's the appeal of it."},
    {"id":"c1-0864","situation":"dominant-run","text":"{winnerClub} can enjoy the sequence without pretending the whole Showdown has already been decided."},
    {"id":"c1-0865","situation":"dominant-run","text":"A spotless set of season victories brings its own pressure. {leader} must now perform as the favorite."},
    {"id":"c1-0866","situation":"dominant-run","text":"I wouldn't mistake the string of wins for a completed Showdown. {leader} still has work ahead."},
    {"id":"c1-0867","situation":"dominant-run","text":"Nobody gets to borrow a season win from {leader}, and that makes the next challenge wonderfully awkward."},
    {"id":"c1-0868","situation":"dominant-run","text":"Listen to us hunting for adjectives, while {winner} simply adds another season victory to the pile."},
    {"id":"c1-0869","situation":"dominant-run","text":"Apparently {winner} has not discovered a season they are willing to let anybody else have."},
    {"id":"c1-0870","situation":"dominant-run","text":"Latest result, familiar destination, {winner} takes the season honours without breaking this extraordinary rhythm."},
    {"id":"c1-0871","situation":"dominant-run","text":"I admire the resolve required to keep winning, especially when the rival has another chance to respond."},
    {"id":"c1-0872","situation":"dominant-run","text":"As a plot twist, a new season winner would be a welcome surprise to everybody but the leader."},
    {"id":"c1-0873","situation":"dominant-run","text":"Picture the next season, {leader} arrives with a flawless run and a fresh challenge to protect it."},
    {"id":"c1-0874","situation":"dominant-run","text":"Take your pick of past campaigns, each one has left {leader} claiming the season honours."},
    {"id":"c1-0875","situation":"dominant-run","text":"I would love to hear the scouting report, because apparently nobody has found the off switch yet."},
    {"id":"c1-0876","situation":"dominant-run","text":"One might think {winner} has a reserved seat in the winner's interview, and nobody has cancelled it."},
    {"id":"c1-0877","situation":"dominant-run","text":"The results desk could save ink writing {leader} first, but {trailer} will want a different story next season."},
    {"id":"c1-0878","situation":"dominant-run","text":"You can almost hear {winnerClub} asking whether the winning column comes with a loyalty card."},
    {"id":"c1-0879","situation":"dominant-run","text":"On this evidence, {leader} considers surrendering a season an entirely optional activity."},
    {"id":"c1-0880","situation":"dominant-run","text":"Anyone booked for the surprise segment? That chair in our studio has remained rather empty."},
    {"id":"c1-0881","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"Years of friendly competition, and {managerA} still knows exactly whose club makes {managerB} sit forward."},
    {"id":"c1-0882","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"At {clubA}, even a tidy season review comes with an extra question, how did the old rival do?"},
    {"id":"c1-0883","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"Neither wants to give an inch, yet {managerB} can still admire the friend pushing from the opposite dugout."},
    {"id":"c1-0884","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"Silverware gets polished, but {managerA} has something less fragile here, a rival worth coming back for."},
    {"id":"c1-0885","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"We've watched {managerA} put another season on the shelf, and the friendly inspection is never far behind."},
    {"id":"c1-0886","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"Bad blood sells a cheap headline, but a rivalry like this has something better, actual staying power."},
    {"id":"c1-0887","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"What's unusual is that {managerA} knows the rival well enough to hear the raised eyebrow from miles away."},
    {"id":"c1-0888","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"Imagine {clubB} in the end-of-season montage, with the rival manager checking every frame for context."},
    {"id":"c1-0889","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"With {clubB} involved, every campaign gets an imaginary footnote, please consult the other manager."},
    {"id":"c1-0890","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"Names become familiar, but the points of disagreement still come dressed in fresh club colours every time."},
    {"id":"c1-0891","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"Here comes {managerB} with fresh ambitions, and the rival will be especially keen to inspect the fine print."},
    {"id":"c1-0892","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"I'd sooner watch {clubA} face a familiar friendly challenge than sit through another manufactured football grudge."},
    {"id":"c1-0893","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"If {managerB} needs a reason to care about the next campaign, try the rival's very existence."},
    {"id":"c1-0894","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"No awkward introductions for {managerB}, the person to impress has been in the picture for ages."},
    {"id":"c1-0895","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"There's no need for villains, {clubA} already has a trusted rival with a wonderfully inconvenient memory."},
    {"id":"c1-0896","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"Compare {clubA} with its rival and you get a football debate that comes with years of context."},
    {"id":"c1-0897","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"Mutual admiration is lovely, though I'd wager the competitive instinct still has its boots by the door."},
    {"id":"c1-0898","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"This panel keeps asking who's under pressure, when the real answer is whoever speaks to the rival next."},
    {"id":"c1-0899","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"It's a rare competition where the next conversation can be every bit as interesting as the next campaign."},
    {"id":"c1-0900","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"Do we charge {managerB} for studio space, or is this friendly debate now a permanent fixture?"},
    {"id":"c1-0901","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"Strange how a casual evening can become a full-length seminar on club management without anybody asking for one."},
    {"id":"c1-0902","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"Put {clubB} on this desk and every pundit suddenly starts practicing the delicate art of diplomatic comparisons."},
    {"id":"c1-0903","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"We're terribly impartial in this studio, until somebody asks us which club we'd rather be managing."},
    {"id":"c1-0904","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"Open the cabinet for {managerA} and you'll find football ambitions, but the friendly rivalry lives beyond the glass."},
    {"id":"c1-0905","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"Apparently these managers can agree on friendship and still produce a disagreement worth its own highlights show."},
    {"id":"c1-0906","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"Here's a thought for {clubA}, the quietest rival may have the loudest opinions once the season ends."},
    {"id":"c1-0907","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"If {managerA} asks for an impartial opinion, asking the other manager might be wonderfully optimistic."},
    {"id":"c1-0908","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"Say it's only a hobby to {managerB}, and the careful tone suggests an extremely competitive hobby."},
    {"id":"c1-0909","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"Perhaps we should display the friendly banter in a museum, provided the exhibits agree to stop debating."},
    {"id":"c1-0910","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"A familiar opponent brings something a new challenger can't, a whole library of old arguments to enjoy."},
    {"id":"c1-0911","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"What a twist for a football rivalry, the person reading the season's story also happens to be a friend."},
    {"id":"c1-0912","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"There's a whole archive in the way {managerB} weighs the rival's progress, years of knowing what matters."},
    {"id":"c1-0913","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"A crest usually says where a club belongs, here it also invites an old friend to judge its ambitions."},
    {"id":"c1-0914","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"You cannot switch off a rivalry like this at the final whistle, only put the conversation on mute."},
    {"id":"c1-0915","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"An old rivalry works like a familiar tune, you know the melody but never quite predict the next verse."},
    {"id":"c1-0916","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"Beneath the studio lights, {managerA} and {managerB} are simply people who refuse to let the conversation fade."},
    {"id":"c1-0917","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"Look past the prizes and there's a much better keepsake, the memories these managers get to share."},
    {"id":"c1-0918","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"Shut the console down and the contest pauses, but the teasing can easily survive the power button."},
    {"id":"c1-0919","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"Not every lasting football memory belongs in a trophy cabinet, some belong in the conversation afterward."},
    {"id":"c1-0920","situation":"rivalry-history","text":"Perhaps the best compliment in football is knowing your old rival still looks forward to facing you."},
    {"id":"c1-0921","situation":"season-preview","text":"Listen, my tip is wonderfully confident for something that hasn't faced a minute of football."},
    {"id":"c1-0922","situation":"season-preview","text":"From this comfortable chair, {managerB} could conquer anything. It's amazing what upholstery does for analysis."},
    {"id":"c1-0923","situation":"season-preview","text":"That's opening night for you, a wall of theories waiting for the first real piece of evidence."},
    {"id":"c1-0924","situation":"season-preview","text":"Oddly enough, my strongest tip is that the person across this desk will disagree with it."},
    {"id":"c1-0925","situation":"season-preview","text":"An untouched page, countless ways to fill it, and a sofa full of people pretending they know the plot."},
    {"id":"c1-0926","situation":"season-preview","text":"Promise is cheap at this stage, but the rivalry will ask for proper payment later."},
    {"id":"c1-0927","situation":"season-preview","text":"Any pundit who sounds certain already should probably be handed a controller instead of a microphone."},
    {"id":"c1-0928","situation":"season-preview","text":"Cards on the table, I've got a hunch, but I wouldn't stake the studio furniture on it."},
    {"id":"c1-0929","situation":"season-preview","text":"Every pundit loves calling a champion early. Funny how the contest insists on being played."},
    {"id":"c1-0930","situation":"season-preview","text":"Nothing is settled, yet this sofa sounds suspiciously like a jury discussing its verdict."},
    {"id":"c1-0931","situation":"season-preview","text":"A fresh challenge is like an unopened envelope, full of possibilities and not a single reliable answer."},
    {"id":"c1-0932","situation":"season-preview","text":"You know what {managerA} has today? The same advantage every competitor shares, a chance to begin again."},
    {"id":"c1-0933","situation":"season-preview","text":"Picture the cabinet doors closed for now. Nobody knows whose hands will reach for the keys."},
    {"id":"c1-0934","situation":"season-preview","text":"No prizes are handed out for bold guesses, otherwise this room would need another trophy shelf."},
    {"id":"c1-0935","situation":"season-preview","text":"Studio arguments are a warmup act. Sooner or later, the actual contest takes the stage."},
    {"id":"c1-0936","situation":"season-preview","text":"Dare we pick a favourite? I'd sooner ask both managers to share the microphone."},
    {"id":"c1-0937","situation":"season-preview","text":"Listen to {managerA} being discussed like a certainty. That's a brave description of an unopened contest."},
    {"id":"c1-0938","situation":"season-preview","text":"The funny thing about a fearless forecast is how quickly real football can ask difficult questions."},
    {"id":"c1-0939","situation":"season-preview","text":"There is a peculiar electricity before kickoff, when a quiet scoreboard seems to challenge everybody."},
    {"id":"c1-0940","situation":"season-preview","text":"Nobody collects a medal for a clever argument in here, thank goodness for our trophy budget."},
    {"id":"c1-0941","situation":"season-preview","text":"Call me cautious, but the trophy deserves better than being awarded by a vote of this sofa."},
    {"id":"c1-0942","situation":"season-preview","text":"Maybe {clubB} becomes the headline act. Maybe the rival steals the spotlight. That's the attraction."},
    {"id":"c1-0943","situation":"season-preview","text":"Just imagine {managerA} watching this panel, wondering which of us will need an apology."},
    {"id":"c1-0944","situation":"season-preview","text":"We're rich in opinions, poor in evidence, and apparently fully booked for another argument."},
    {"id":"c1-0945","situation":"season-preview","text":"Eventually, our wild guesses will be judged against reality, and this sofa may want to hide."},
    {"id":"c1-0946","situation":"season-preview","text":"Every crown looks wonderful in a preview. The difficult business is earning the right to wear it."},
    {"id":"c1-0947","situation":"season-preview","text":"A prediction is only a starting pistol, and nobody should mistake it for the finish."},
    {"id":"c1-0948","situation":"season-preview","text":"We might be wrong about absolutely everything, which is half the charm of this job."},
    {"id":"c1-0949","situation":"season-preview","text":"First comes the promise. Then comes that awkward little detail called having to deliver."},
    {"id":"c1-0950","situation":"season-preview","text":"This whole rivalry is balanced on an unopened door, and either manager might push it wide."},
    {"id":"c1-0951","situation":"season-preview","text":"I'd love a guarantee from {clubA}, but even the best intentions don't come with a warranty."},
    {"id":"c1-0952","situation":"season-preview","text":"Whatever this sofa declares tonight, {managerB} still has the right to prove it wrong."},
    {"id":"c1-0953","situation":"season-preview","text":"Now comes the delicious uncertainty, whose ambitions will withstand all the twists nobody can predict?"},
    {"id":"c1-0954","situation":"season-preview","text":"Put {managerB} in the hypothetical hot seat, ask for a forecast, and listen to this desk disagree with itself."},
    {"id":"c1-0955","situation":"season-preview","text":"You can almost hear the debate starting, and {clubA} has yet to make its opening statement."},
    {"id":"c1-0956","situation":"season-preview","text":"Nobody has lifted anything yet, which is exactly why this rivalry feels so deliciously wide open."},
    {"id":"c1-0957","situation":"season-preview","text":"Look at {managerA}, enjoying that rare managerial luxury, a plan nobody has had the chance to test."},
    {"id":"c1-0958","situation":"season-preview","text":"Here's a question nobody at this desk can answer, whose great plan survives the first serious test?"},
    {"id":"c1-0959","situation":"season-preview","text":"Tonight {managerB} gets the luxury every manager loves, being judged on what might happen."},
    {"id":"c1-0960","situation":"season-preview","text":"Imagine the argument if both managers could pick their own headline before playing a game."}
  ]);
